#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1154192"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1154248"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1154332"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1154412"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "1154480"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "1154520"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "1154552"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154584"
msgid "I was on the verge of leaving the Student\nCouncil Room when #C236196003Sakura#CDEF abruptly thanked me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154688"
msgid "The others and I looked at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in surprise\nafter hearing her unprefaced remark."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154788"
msgid "I ask her why she was thanking me. Then…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154832"
msgid "I am sorry… as I thought, it looks like this\nnew software has destabilized my emotion values\na little bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154940"
msgid "Please be careful out there. Be sure to come\nback without a scratch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155012"
msgid "A variety of information is displayed here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155056"
msgid "However, it's really tough to read from this close up.\nIt would help to back up a bit, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155152"
msgid "I wonder if there are any cleaning supplies in here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155208"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, sweeping up the Student Council Room\nwith a broom or dust cloth. Or #C236196003Gawain#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155324"
msgid "I kind of want to see them doing that stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155372"
msgid "There's a note stuck to the cleaning locker.\nWhat's it say…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155436"
msgid "[The auto-cleaning type OpenLock.\n Upon opening, the door will not close\n until the Student Council Room is left\n without a single speck of dust.\n Patent pending.]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155600"
msgid "―――Who the hell would want to open this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155648"
msgid "Many books are stored on this shelf.\nThey all look exceedingly complicated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155724"
msgid "…but, in the corner of my eye,\nI felt like I saw the string of letters:\n\"My Little Sister Can't Be This Hyper-Conceited.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155848"
msgid "Books are tightly lined up all the way to the ceiling.\nA large assortment of genres are here, like\nhistory, literature, and economics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155984"
msgid "Between the books, I find \"A History Of Tsukumihara Academy.\"\nWorn out pictures of the school are printed in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156100"
msgid "………\nI miss my peaceful life as a student, just a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156160"
msgid "It's a book about the Harwey family\nand a West European financial conglomerate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156240"
msgid "\"The Western European Conglomerate was formed out of an\n immense merging of several conglomerates spanning multiple\n countries. Geographically, it covers 1/3 of the world.\n 60% of the global GDP is considered to come from\n the Western European Conglomerate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156500"
msgid "There's no one left from the Harwey family\nin the Student Council Room anymore.\nMaybe that's why I came upon a book like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156628"
msgid "It looks like a garbage bin,\nbut there's nothing inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156688"
msgid "……!\nHold on. I feel like I saw some black thing move just now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156756"
msgid "No, just my imagination.\nNo doubt about it… I'll leave it at that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156828"
msgid "…hey.\nThere's something that's been bothering me.\nYou have a second?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156900"
msgid "It's about #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF.\nOut of curiosity, I had #C236196003Rani#CDEF look into her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157004"
msgid "We have nothing to be concerned about.\nIt's true that the western financial\nconglomerates went after her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157112"
msgid "The conglomerates went after her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157148"
msgid "So #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is an enemy of those conglomerates――\nIs she a freelance hacker like #C236196003Rin#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157268"
msgid "No, she doesn't oppose anyone. Though the only\ndata we have comes from what we dug up here…\nCould you please, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157404"
msgid "Yes. Starting from the conclusion,\nshe's a cybercriminal wanted by INTERPOL."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157484"
msgid "At one point,\nshe was the leader of a religious cyber cult.\nIt no longer exists, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157576"
msgid "And, well…\nAll the men and women in it idolized her\nso much that they all committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157672"
msgid "People who were smitten with her,\npeople with a thing for being abused by her,\npeople hooked on conversing with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157792"
msgid "People who detested her to death,\npeople who were crazy over her body…\nA lot of different folks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157892"
msgid "The end results were all the same: suicide.\nEven outside the internet, most of the people\nwho associated with her committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158028"
msgid "Included among them were even\ncyber investigators and spies from the\nconglomerates that had chased her around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158140"
msgid "What's astonishing is that apparently,\none spy died in order to save her\nfrom adherents who were out to kill her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158256"
msgid "…according to these documents,\nthat person was apparently her lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158328"
msgid "According to #C236196003Julius#CDEF, that person was\na misanthrope and didn't seem particularly\ninterested in women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158448"
msgid "…personally, I can't comprehend\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's cognitive structure.\nShe's too much of an enigma."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158564"
msgid "She was betrayed by others over and over again.\nAnd yet, she didn't abandon her goal\nof bringing salvation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158672"
msgid "Or rather… It makes me think that\nshe's fine with being betrayed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158740"
msgid "You could say she has an indomitable spirit,\nbut in her case, it goes much too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158824"
msgid "I may not be one to say this, but…\nIt's as if she's a machine devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158908"
msgid "I think so, too. It's like she's obsessed\nwith being a hero of justice? Or something.\nShe's even being called \"the last saint.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159036"
msgid "One thing's for sure: she's the biggest victim.\nBut it's also true that she's the cause\nof mass suicide and conflict."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159156"
msgid "Thus, with backing from the conglomerates,\nshe was added to the world's most wanted list.\nThough some came to her legal defense…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159288"
msgid "A woman emerges, is treated as a saint\nin the East, and disregards their group――\nGuess they couldn't let that one slip by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159416"
msgid "You're being biased, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF was considered \"clearly a\nmodern-day saint,\" even by the Church."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159564"
msgid "The problem is that the person who started\ninsisting on that was a Church cardinal…\nAnd a candidate for the next papacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159688"
msgid "The Holy Church didn't try to apprehend #C236196003Kiara#CDEF\nbecause she was some thorn in their side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159792"
msgid "They recognized her as the highest class of\nthreat to the preservation of their faith."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159880"
msgid "T-they're being way more vicious than they\nneed to be! What about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's virtue!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159980"
msgid "I think it should be called \"magical powers\"\nat this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160040"
msgid "It was only for a brief time… just two months\nthat he was in contact with #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF,\nbut his nature truly became that of a saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160192"
msgid "That resulted in the Church going after her.\nShe was betrayed by her faith and many people,\nand was denounced as a murderer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160320"
msgid "…okay. We're taking the wrong route by\nbringing Earth affairs into the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160420"
msgid "Well, yeah. But, while I partially agree,\nI think #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160508"
msgid "That girl there's an airhead.\nShe has no clue how much she drives\neveryone around her insane."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160604"
msgid "The nickname she got stuck with,\n\"The Devilish Bodhisattva,\" really sums her up.\nWhy is that, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160724"
msgid "Please refrain from making\nunnecessary contact with her from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160796"
msgid "When I came to, I was in front of the cherry blossom tree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160856"
msgid "It felt like I spent years in the Imaginary Number Space,\nbut simply being back here relaxes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160956"
msgid "Although, I never would've dreamed that the day would come\nwhen I'd get \"nostalgic\" about this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161064"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nI'm glad you made it back in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161128"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and the others are gathered in the schoolyard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161220"
msgid "I can see the same fatigue in all of their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161272"
msgid "It's as if they had each escaped some peril,\nand came here to check up on one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161360"
msgid "Not \"as if,\" that's exactly what happened,\napparently. I'm sure you also had a rough time,\nbut we were in a pinch, ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161488"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF became #C236196003BB#CDEF's stooge and ambushed us.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, and I were in the Student Council\nRoom, and we were on the verge of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161684"
msgid "After that, because #C236196003Sakura#CDEF had collapsed,\nthe old school's barrier was lifted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161780"
msgid "And of course, that's when hostile programs from\nthe Labyrinth invaded, and NPCs in the school\nwere systematically attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161908"
msgid "…so that's how it went down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161940"
msgid "The old school is protected by #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYour average hostile program can't enter,\nand even #C236196003BB#CDEF can only affect us by \"observing the inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162112"
msgid "However, the Masters #C236196003Sakura#CDEF regards as the\n\"subjects of her guardianship\" are different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162220"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, a Master, returned to the old school, \nrendered #C236196003Sakura#CDEF powerless, and lifted the barrier.\nHe attacked #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and then ushered hostile programs\ninto the mayhem-afflicted building to gain control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162496"
msgid "On #C236196003BB#CDEF's command, he commandeered this space\nin just a few minutes, but still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162596"
msgid "Externally, it looked like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and\nthe NPCs were on the verge of death,\nbut the damage they took wasn't fatal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162728"
msgid "Then, #C236196003Rani#CDEF and I were pushed into\nthe Imaginary Number Space,\nand everyone else was left in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162852"
msgid "That's all that happened.\nEveryone managed to find their own way back\nand got here just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162948"
msgid "…what about you two?\nWe were able to monitor up until #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nwas defeated, but what happened after that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163068"
msgid "I explained to #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nthe sequence of events up until this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163148"
msgid "About how #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF are gone.\nAbout how #C236196003Julius#CDEF saved me in his final moments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163280"
msgid "And also about how #C236196003BB#CDEF's true goal is\nto head to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163384"
msgid "………I see.\nIt's a shame what happened to #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163476"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's thoughts on the matter end there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163532"
msgid "I didn't expect her to give no response on #C236196003BB#CDEF's motive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163604"
msgid "What, about how she's heading for the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF? Well, I was already thinking\nthat might happen in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163736"
msgid "The absolute worst case scenario I assumed\ncame to be. That's it.\nIt's scary, but not surprising."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163836"
msgid "It sounds like #C236196003Rin#CDEF had predicted, roughly,\nwhat \"#C236196003BB#CDEF ultimately had her eyes on.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163952"
msgid "No wonder she's the Student Council Vice President.\nShe's as reliable as a person can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164044"
msgid "Though, I didn't think her goal would be\nsomething like \"a world where desires are\nunleashed.\" That's one awful future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164164"
msgid "We can't stand here being gloomy all day.\nI'll light a fire under everyone's ass and\nget us reorganized. You go get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164292"
msgid "…I don't know what happened to you\nand I won't ask,\nbut your internals are all shattered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164384"
msgid "You're holding up for now, but I can tell\nyou're cobbled together. You're so mangled,\nI'm impressed you can still think rationally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164516"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nApparently, for someone with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's level of observation,\nthey can easily catch on to how wounded my body is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164660"
msgid "I'm not hurting anymore,\nbut if #C236196003Rin#CDEF is telling me to rest, then I should rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164756"
msgid "To those who are in good health, she says \"go fight.\"\nAnd to those who must rest, she says \"go rest.\"\nPointing out the difference is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's kindness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164932"
msgid "Have you made your preparations?\nWe're ready to take position and back you up."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1165012"
msgid "All right, let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165036"
msgid "Got it. Alright, let's have you dive\ninto the world of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165124"
msgid "Understood. I'll guide you into the world\nof #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind, President #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165236"
msgid "If you go in unprepared, we're all doomed.\nWe're on full standby until you're ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165324"
msgid "More prudence is needed from you today\ncompared to your usual explorations.\nBe fully prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165420"
msgid "By the way, about that recent Psycho Dive:\nwhat did you think about being inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165528"
msgid "Hey! #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…!\nThe way you're saying it is,\nin many ways, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165608"
msgid "? Why are you getting so embarrassed?\nYou're an AI. Aren't you used to having your\ninternal structure investigated?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165724"
msgid "Is that so? Well, there are only a few #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF\nwho can hack one of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's advanced AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165876"
msgid "……… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nI apologize for Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's rudeness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165964"
msgid "She has a tendency to be overly logical\nabout hacking. One could say she's\nprone to being more inhumane than us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166080"
msgid "Huh? This is no big deal for a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND.\nWhy're you staring at me like that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166204"
msgid "As you can see, she lacks delicacy. I'm still\nlearning about emotions, but Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nis an excellent teacher. Of what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166352"
msgid "Ah, I know what you mean.\nWhen I look at #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, I try to be more\nconscious about the hem of my skirt…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166476"
msgid "…you two get along really well, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166520"
msgid "…need something?\nAs you can see, I don't feel like talking.\nLeave me alone for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166612"
msgid "Man, what is it?\nHave something you want to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1166664"
msgid "…what's an \"Observed Universe\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166700"
msgid "Then be quiet! …ah, sorry.\nIt's terrible to lash out at an innocent person.\nBut honestly, I'm not very composed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166816"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF…?\nAhh, I did explain something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166896"
msgid "\"Here, time doesn't pass.\nIf we were in a loop, we might've still\nhad a chance…\" Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167000"
msgid "But this situation is nothing like that kind of\nfar-fetched dream. We can't change the \"result\"\nthat occurred no matter what we do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167132"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is a world made of\nImaginary Numbers. There IS a concept of time,\nbut how it works differs from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167280"
msgid "I suppose I should say it's the difference\nbetween \"perceived time\" and \"recorded time.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167372"
msgid "Look, we're talking about this right now\nin the present, right? But…\nOne, two, three…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167460"
msgid "There. Now what I said three seconds ago\nbecame \"the past.\" Even though we're still\nin the #ROFS0004#RUBSpresent#RUBEmiddle#REND of our conversation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167612"
msgid "This is the perceived flow of time.\nThrough humans' \"own perception,\" we separate\ntime and space into past, present, and future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167744"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universes#CDEF have very simple laws of\nphysics. People can't see what comes after the\npresent, but they can influence the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167896"
msgid "It's a bit late to mention this, but the real\nworld and the Near Side of the Moon are managed\nby this #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF. With me so far?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168052"
msgid "Basically, our world is the one with\n\"time that we perceive.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168116"
msgid "Humans perceive the \"past\" as\nconstantly updating into the \"present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168188"
msgid "From that present, we observe the \"future\"\nwhich eventually comes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168256"
msgid "But a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF's laws are different.\nA #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF is perceived from several\ndimensions above: a high dimensional entity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168428"
msgid "From the perspective of a higher dimension,\nthe third dimension looks like a flat scroll."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168520"
msgid "Umm, it's like if the 3-D world was a world\nprinted in a book, and you jumped from within\nthe book and landed outside the book."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168648"
msgid "You could then look down at the records\nof your past, present, and future that's in\nthe book whenever you wanted――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168768"
msgid "That's the perspective of a higher dimension.\nYou get it, right? With that being the case,\nall time within the book has equal value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168904"
msgid "It's the same thing here.\nThis is an Imaginary Number Space, a higher\ndimensional data space made out of light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169016"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is fundamentally\nmanaged through the laws of a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF,\nnot an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169184"
msgid "We're foreign matter… No, we're guests here.\nCreatures from an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nthat got tossed into a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169340"
msgid "But, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core is a parallel world\nsimulator where past, present, and future exist\nsimultaneously, with all outcomes calculated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169496"
msgid "Basically, it's a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\nAnd now #C236196003BB#CDEF's become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. She gained\nthe perspective of a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169676"
msgid "That's why――\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can manipulate the past and future\nat the same time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169764"
msgid "The moment #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core, she gained\nthe power to select a future and set it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169864"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF was purely the Eye of God.\nWith an AI like #C236196003BB#CDEF mixed in now,\nit's become the Brain of God."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170000"
msgid "I don't know what the future will look like in\na few hours, but either way, #C236196003BB#CDEF reached\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. That truth ISN'T changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170164"
msgid "She's now become a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can make facts retroactive. She can make it\nso that she knew \"this present\" would come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170332"
msgid "…it's all pretty confusing.\nOnce #C236196003BB#CDEF became the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, she became able\nto tell her past self about \"this present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170484"
msgid "\"Chasing after her as if we might make it in time somehow.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170544"
msgid "That act itself was futile.\nIt was decided from the beginning that\n#C236196003BB#CDEF would reach the Core in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170664"
msgid "…anyway, that's how it is.\nIf you get it now, then be quiet for me.\nWe can't win against god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170760"
msgid "If you're feeling restless, then how about\n#C000246204walking around the school#CDEF? It's safe, after all.\nWe're being kept in here like pets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170904"
msgid "…still need something? You need backup\nbecause you're going to the Labyrinth?\nYou're farming experience with your Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171028"
msgid "…listen. Were you not paying attention\nto what we've been saying? It's pointless.\nAnything we do now is pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171144"
msgid "The life is draining from their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171184"
msgid "More so than the fact that #C236196003BB#CDEF is far too powerful,\nthe fact that we've lost what we were trying to protect\nhas stolen their will to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171340"
msgid "…I know how they feel.\nI was in the same state of mind not too long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171416"
msgid "I can't force them to fight on against their will.\nHowever, their abilities will be vital\nif I want to enter the Central Region again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171552"
msgid "I need to somehow get them to help me,\neven if it's just getting me to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171656"
msgid "Enough of this! You morons! Listening quietly\nto your nonsense is doing us no good! You call\nyourselves my #RUBS Praetor's#RUBEMaster's#REND women!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171816"
msgid "Straighten yourselves up, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF!\nIs this how the top #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF of\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF act!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172008"
msgid "Heads out of your asses, ladies!\nWhat's got you all so spineless!? This ain't\nno pinch for us, not by a long shot!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172124"
msgid "Bah! How long will you stare at the floor, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF!? Is this the miser and the observing\ndemon; Amazons who stood before me!? Fools!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172292"
msgid "――――Wha――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172308"
msgid "Battles are fought until you prevail! You may\nlose, your life may be taken―but if you won't\nrise up with indomitable will, then what!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172444"
msgid "This is the one time you SHOULD follow my\nexample! Fight until you've fallen thrice\nand risen thrice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172548"
msgid "Your premise is all wrong, anyhow.\nYou say the future is fixed?\nWhat else is new!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172632"
msgid "People have no influence over the past or\nfuture. \"Changing the future\" was already\na ridiculous idea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172736"
msgid "People have influence only over the present.\nHaven't you already proven that doing so\nresults in changing the future!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172856"
msgid "Listen. Our coming battles aren't pointless.\nActually―― There's no such thing as\n\"pointless battles\" when it comes to humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172984"
msgid "You stop because you see the end result. If it\nwere common sense to do so, human civilization\nwouldn't have developed as it has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173116"
msgid "And most of all, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF――\nYou're thinking about it all wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173216"
msgid "Sure, anything that's \"decided\" here in the Far\nSide is absolute. #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core.\nNothing can probably change that now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173360"
msgid "However―― You CAN add a new, small detail\nto that outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173424"
msgid "Things have no end. Something always continues\non after. Don't be misled by how things\nare in Imaginary Number Spaces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173544"
msgid "Even under the laws of a higher dimension,\nbetween the present and future is the tiniest\nblank space where one can write in a sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173680"
msgid "\"The Moon was destroyed by a witch.\"\n\"However―― By the efforts of adamant youths,\nthe world was narrowly saved.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173796"
msgid "So.\nFor what purpose do your skills exist for?\nSo you can sit here and be at your wits' end?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173892"
msgid "Ahem.\nPlease don't look so down, you two.\nHold off on resignation for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173980"
msgid "I know I'm sticking my nose in, but that's why\nI'm going to go ahead and say this:\nwe haven't been defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174092"
msgid "Please look at Darling. No matter how many times\n#[he][she]# loses or runs, #[he][she]# nonchalantly survives\nand eventually brings about an upset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174240"
msgid "So long as we have someone who plays\ndirty like this, \"somehow always winning\nin the end,\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174332"
msgid "The present exists so we can do something about\nit. The future may be decided, but that doesn't\nmean you can't change the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174464"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF has fallen, certainly.\nThere was never any future in store for you all\nwhere you stopped that from happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174612"
msgid "Isn't it natural? She crafted a premise\nwhere your \"victory\" was shut out,\nthen summoned you all here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174716"
msgid "So far, it's all as #C236196003BB#CDEF planned. You all merely\ndance in the palm of her hand. But, she doesn't\nknow of the slight irregularities inside her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174876"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's calculations end here. She intended to\nbring everything to a close with her victory and\nyour defeat―as the future had been set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175028"
msgid "However. There remains some with will\nyet to fight… Fools who refuse to disappear,\nrather; who persist after defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175148"
msgid "Your fated defeat can't be reversed.\nThat's one impossible request even I\ncan't grant. That is why――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175252"
msgid "Get through the events set in stone, and all\nthat's left after is a blank page.\nThat's where your fight takes place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175372"
msgid "How presumptuous to think you can\nchange the future, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175436"
msgid "#ROFS-009#RUBSThe present#RUBE\"Now\"#REND constantly passes, #ROFS-003#RUBSthe future#RUBE\"next\"#REND is a cloth\ncontinually woven in extension,\nand I am the eternal, undying King of Heroes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175628"
msgid "So long as I exist, there is no \"end.\" If you\nforesee a future of ruin, then change the nuance\nof the meaning, as when history is compiled!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175768"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's encouragement echoes throughout\nthe sullen Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175856"
msgid "It was as if a wave washed over us.\nThe tan girl is the first to regain herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175940"
msgid "――――That's true.\nAhh. I wonder why I didn't realize it sooner,\nit's so obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176024"
msgid "All #C236196003BB#CDEF did was decide the future.\nThe future might not be alterable,\nbut the present is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176132"
msgid "After all―― The present is still our domain.\nIt's the one thing an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nhas over a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176284"
msgid "A familiar glint returns to the red girl's eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176336"
msgid "…I faintly recall something.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she lent me a hand many\ntimes despite us being enemies.\nShe was a worthy rival, brimming with life\nwho always sought to play fair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176536"
msgid "And even though I had said it myself once\nbefore: stopping #C236196003BB#CDEF isn't the objective\nof this fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176652"
msgid "That's right. The reason the future is decided\nis because a \"present where we defeated #C236196003BB#CDEF\"\ndoesn't exist here in the Far Side yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176800"
msgid "But if we can create that present, we can\ncreate a new possibility. The future will have\na different outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176912"
msgid "With two futures, the future that occurred\nhere will decouple with the present world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177000"
msgid "…to be honest, defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF might not make\na huge difference to the future at this point,\nfor all we know. Still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177136"
msgid "Still, a computational error WILL arise.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF will be eliminated, and the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will\nreturn to normal. That itself is worth it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177300"
msgid "Exactly.\nAt last you've regained\nyour previous sensibility!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177360"
msgid "Exactly.\nYou two really do have the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177412"
msgid "Splendidly done鷙\n…honestly, making Darling fight alone is bit\nof a heavy burden for anyone to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177516"
msgid "…hmph. Look at me rallying these cretins\nback to their feet. So foolish.\nKnow that this is your fault, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177632"
msgid "Though this doesn't mean I've redeemed myself.\nFrom here on out, I'll be giving my\nall as an operator."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177736"
msgid "…I feel the same. We're the ones crafting\nthe strategies, yet we ended up becoming\na burden on you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177840"
msgid "\"I'll at least get sent to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177900"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are more outstanding #C000246204Magi#CDEF, fighters than I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178008"
msgid "Because they have superior judgement,\nthey were more realistic in discerning #C236196003BB#CDEF's\ncomparative strength and our situation,\nwhich overwhelmed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178172"
msgid "They felt worry and anxiety magnitudes more than I did."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178228"
msgid "…yeah. I knew full well how strong #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas compared to us from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178328"
msgid "\"We're no match for her.\" \"We can't do anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178380"
msgid "If reasons like that are stopping us in our tracks,\nthen we're not putting up much of a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178476"
msgid "He knew that we would lose.\nHe knew we couldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178532"
msgid "Still―― He entrusted everything to\nsomeone who hadn't yet given up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178604"
msgid "Alright. So now we're facing two issues:\nThe first is that huge Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178684"
msgid "Yes. Without destroying that Core,\nwe can't reach the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF.\nIt truly is our final obstacle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178804"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nWearing a grave expression,\nshe returns to the Student Council Room from the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178920"
msgid "…#C000246204SGs#CDEF may be secrets,\nbut I don't think that makes them traumas…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179004"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. If what you say is true,\nthen can you quickly do something about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179104"
msgid "…………yes.\nEven I can destroy that wall.\nI know I didn't bring it up at the time…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179192"
msgid "No, there was no helping it.\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's mental state was\nabnormal at the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179292"
msgid "Hey, are you saying it's MY fault!?\nGah… Sure, yeah, it was my fault!\nThat huge thing was incredible, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179408"
msgid "So please, don't hesitate to\nremove that Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179468"
msgid "Please allow me one condition to open that door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179520"
msgid "I'm an AI that manages everyone's health and\nsafety. Technically, I have to oppose you all\ngoing off to fight a battle you can't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179656"
msgid "…I won't say anything more to stop you.\nI'll be aiding you in your fight, everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179744"
msgid "No. I can't approve as things stand now.\nWe need a countermeasure against #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nPlease find a way to disable her #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179900"
msgid "Once you do so, I'll open up the Labyrinth\nCore… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind. That's the one and only\ncondition I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180024"
msgid "So #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says,\nher eyes bearing determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180088"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\"――\nShe has a point. Disabling that skill is the\nminimum we need to do. Let's start by consulting #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180240"
msgid "Should we start the dive?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1180268"
msgid "Give me a little more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180296"
msgid "Make it quick, okay?\nTime does hardly pass here,\nbut unforeseen forces could \"get it moving.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180392"
msgid "\"I'm all set.\"\nI reply to #C236196003Rin#CDEF that I'm ready whenever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180464"
msgid "Then let's get started.\nWe'll have #C236196003#SVT#CDEF enter an idle state.\nAnd you'll take this, here:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180572"
msgid "It's been decided, so please just roll with it.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, are we ready?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180680"
msgid "I'm ready as well.\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, once you've dived in,\nhurry towards the center of your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180800"
msgid "There will be a battle against my primal self,\nwhich even I know nothing of. …is there\nany way to avoid that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180912"
msgid "A \"me\" that even I know nothing about, huh…\nIs there any way to restrain this \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181000"
msgid "I would like to ask something, just in case…\nIs there any way to restrain this cornerstone\n\"me,\" this #ROFS0006#RUBSanimal#RUBEprimal#REND \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181148"
msgid "You can guess what will happen with my\nprototype. Just to be sure, is there no way to\navoid battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181248"
msgid "It's probably not possible. To a \"#C000246204Mythical\nMystic Code#CDEF\"― the \"root,\" logic and instincts\nare a nuisance. I think battle is unavoidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181404"
msgid "It's an origin that you have no knowledge of, so\nplease think of it as a different person… or\na phenomenon which shares only your looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181544"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nWhile #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF is undertaking the mission,\nyou'll be able to do nothing but watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181664"
msgid "…it's still a highly dangerous mission,\nbut you have no choice but to believe in us.\nPlease entrust this to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181780"
msgid "…okay.\nYes, I've taken up time needlessly.\nI place my Praetor in your hands, #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181880"
msgid "I see, that makes sense.\nThen―― Please make use of my body.\nI place the life of my #RUBS Darling#RUBEMaster#REND in your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182012"
msgid "Come, now. There's nothing to fret over. That\nman has a tendency to size up his enemies.\nHe won't take a mongrel seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182136"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF entrusts #SVT[her][his][her][his]# body to #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182224"
msgid "Looks like, in my case――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF will be handling me.\nThey will extract my soul from my digital frame,\nconvert it into an independent \"unit,\"\nthen send it into #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's \"soul.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182456"
msgid "Now, close your eyes. When the conversion\nstarts, I think you'll feel a bit squished,\nbut don't wiggle around too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182576"
msgid "Extracting soul from the body and mind.\nBeginning telepathy via the #C000246204Multi-Colored\nTranquility#CDEF―― #RUBS  Origin connect#RUBECore contact#REND, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182744"
msgid "Oh, yeah.\nYou mind giving me back the cube #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nis sealed in?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182824"
msgid "As the one who set that mechanism up,\nit's my responsibility to hold on to it."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1182904"
msgid "…about that―― Lancer is…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1182936"
msgid "…can you let me have this cube?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182972"
msgid "…it pains me to talk about it,\nbut I'll tell #C236196003Rin#CDEF about what happened:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183060"
msgid "About #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's magnificent heroism.\nAbout the end of the girl who dreamt of being\na diva up until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183188"
msgid "Huh? #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is still alive, against all odds.\nLooks like she's sleeping like a baby\nin the cube."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183304"
msgid "Th-then, after we parted so dramatically, she\nonly went back because she was tired!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183392"
msgid "Okay, I'll be taking this from you♪\nWah! What's going on!? Her bad karma\ndropped like crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183488"
msgid "Ugh… That means headaches for me… It's going\nto be hell taking care of this annoying girl\nwhen I'm an old lady…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183604"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF was magnificent up until the very end. \nIt wouldn't do her justice to sum up her bravery\nas resulting from \"her just being sad\"―\nEven if she WAS our enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183784"
msgid "You sure?\nI don't mind, but it's a big responsibility,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183852"
msgid "It's a cursed item, see. Throwing it\naway willy-nilly will come back to bite you,\nand holding on to it lowers your luck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183976"
msgid "Well, karma like hers won't go away in one or\neven two hundred years. That there will probably\nstay a box until you pass away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184104"
msgid "Hang in there.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF may be powerful, but hey, I know\nyou'll make it through someway or another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184220"
msgid "After all, that's how you've gotten\nall your wins up 'til now.\nI'm not worried. It's just that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184320"
msgid "I hate to put pressure on you,\nbut don't mess up in the final stretch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184392"
msgid "If we don't stop that AI, #C236196003BB#CDEF…\nwe won't be able to bounce back…\nThat's the feeling I'm getting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184508"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184556"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184704"
msgid "Wh-what is it…? You look like you haven't said\nenough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184764"
msgid "Prepare yourself for when we get back to the\nNear Side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184820"
msgid "*sigh*… If I had my #C236196003Lancer#CDEF with me, this \nwouldn't have happened…\nWhat a terrible blunder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184932"
msgid "Eh? \"What happened to that #C236196003blue Lancer#CDEF,\"\nyou ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185000"
msgid "Right about now he must be in the Near Side\nscratching his head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185068"
msgid "And only I was pulled into the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. If I don't get back quickly, he'll\nprobably run out of mana and disappear…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185216"
msgid "The more of the Labyrinth's info you gather,\nthe easier it'll be for me to hack it.\nI'm counting on you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185344"
msgid "Hey. Incidentally, is that #C236196003Leo#CDEF over there the\nREAL #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185432"
msgid "You can change in My Room.\nWhy not try heading back and changing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185500"
msgid "I like my clothes, so I'll be staying like this.\nI've always wanted to wear a uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185588"
msgid "You can change clothes in My Room.\nGive it a try when you have other\noutfits to wear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185676"
msgid "Y-you can't go around wearing that!\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF may approve, but I don't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185760"
msgid "At last, the third and final #C000246204SG#CDEF. Hmhmhm.\nWhatever sort of secret it is, I'm going to\ndrag it out into the sunlight―― Just watch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185908"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nH-how long were you standing there!?\nAhahahaha. N-nice weather today, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186012"
msgid "A secret even she doesn't realize she has…\nIs it possible, considering it's #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186112"
msgid "Jeeeez! How are we supposed to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF in\nher domain!? Let us try something WE'RE good\nat, come on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186232"
msgid "Eh? What's my strong suit? Umm… Ch-Chinese\ncooking, and cyber terrorism, and money systems,\nand yeah, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186348"
msgid "Good work. I never thought #C236196003Jinako#CDEF would get\nthe third #C000246204SG#CDEF for us. I'm surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186460"
msgid "At any rate, \"#C000246204Powergamer#CDEF,\" huh… Pfft.\nWhat kind of a naming sense is that?\nIt's no wonder #C236196003Rani#CDEF is pissed off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186604"
msgid "Just hearing that broadcast makes\nme tense up, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186664"
msgid "By the way, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. What kind of food\ndo you like? Wanna try having a cooking battle\nbetween us later?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186784"
msgid "About #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, I don't really get along with\nher, or rather, we're not very compatible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186888"
msgid "It's not that I don't like her or anything. It's\njust that our ways of life are different in too\nmany ways. It's hard to approach her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187024"
msgid "…hey. Now WHY do I get the feeling\nyou're looking at my chest? You think different\nmeans in terms of \"size,\" eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187140"
msgid "Alright, kneel down. Then repent. If you keep\nup the sexual harassment, I'll skin you alive\nand toss you into the Styx鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187264"
msgid "Eh? You understand? I'm so glad! It sort of\nfeels like we're tight-knit now―― Hey. \nWhy do I feel your gaze on my chest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187388"
msgid "…yeah, they do.\nThat's why the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF exists.\nIt was dumb of me to ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187488"
msgid "Her chest is her #C000246204SG#CDEF… Her chest being an #C000246204SG#CDEF…\nThere's SO much showing already, how can\nit even be a secret!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187632"
msgid "If they're such a bother, why not share\nwith people who could use some!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187708"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I'm talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187756"
msgid "Don't keep asking the obvious.\nIf you keep pretending to be thickheaded,\nI really will kill you, hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187864"
msgid "Good work. At least this #C000246204SG#CDEF was an\neasy one to get as well. Keep it up for\nthe next one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187972"
msgid "Although… About all the problems, outside of\ngetting the #C000246204SG#CDEF, all I can really do is give you\nmy condolences. Try your best, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188124"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF! Phew, I'm glad you're back in\none piece. Thinking about the worst happening\nto you makes me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188244"
msgid "Without you, we'd have no one to\nexplore the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, okay?\nThat's all I meant! Really, that's ALL!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188372"
msgid "Pester me anymore, and I'll spread a virus\nacross the Labyrinth that melts only clothes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188464"
msgid "Going with the essentially unreasonable #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nor the punishment of being with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nIn a sense, it's the ultimate decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188624"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is surprisingly normal, huh?\nA lot like you, don't you think, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188732"
msgid "You don't get what I mean? Oh, come on～\nIt doesn't mean anything～ I wasn't thinking\nanything like \"couple of bores.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188852"
msgid "You must be worried about things, but get\nsome rest, first. We'll do as much as we\ncan in the meantime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188956"
msgid "You're up against an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nStrong, but not someone you can't necessarily\nbeat. Do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189072"
msgid "You alright, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nAre your memories jumbled up in any way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189152"
msgid "Me…?\nI'm okay. I'm not the delicate type that\nloses her cool over something like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189240"
msgid "I don't get why #C236196003Leo#CDEF, as neatly perfect as he is,\nis so indifferent when it comes to a woman's\nheart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189360"
msgid "He probably didn't have people around him who\nwould teach him about that sort of thing,\nrather than it just being his personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189492"
msgid "But now I think about it, he does have #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nwith him, who's very down-to-earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189592"
msgid "Huh? You never realized that?\nIt's just that he has a poker face.\nYou'd be surprised how much he reacts to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189700"
msgid "Well, if he were any more delicate with women,\nhe'd be perfect to the point of being creepy.\nHow he is now may be just right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189828"
msgid "Goofs are way more dangerous than folks\nof conviction. That's because they have\nno self-awareness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189928"
msgid "I don't get along with saint-type people\nin the first place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189992"
msgid "I think she ACTUALLY has some screws\nloose somewhere. Serving others without\nany reward, really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190092"
msgid "And that's why, though being suspicious of her\nis a little extreme, we should be careful\nto not trust #C236196003Kiara#CDEF too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190228"
msgid "Too much of a good thing is bad for you. If you\nget too used to people being nice to you,\nyou start turning soft, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190352"
msgid "Hehehehe.\nWe've got that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF by the neck, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190420"
msgid "Just you wait!\nPayback just got an interest hike――\nMy thanks for messing with us at your whimsy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190520"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190568"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190716"
msgid "I know it's been tough recently, but…\nUltimately, you have to go to the Labyrinth and\nget the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF. That hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190880"
msgid "Give it your best, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190920"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's invitation is pretty much a trap.\nDon't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191012"
msgid "Keep in mind―― You can't eat something that's\nnot food, even if the person that made it\ninsists they made it with love. Capiche?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191144"
msgid "It dealt THAT much damage just from its purely\nawful flavor? It's extraordinary, in one\nsense… I wonder what spices she used…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191272"
msgid "What surprises me even more is that even after \nall that damage you took, you're good as new,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191392"
msgid "What's the deal with your stomach?\nLet us #RUBS   scan#RUBEanalyze#REND you thoroughly later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191488"
msgid "HUH? She ran away? What's going on!?\nWe're fine here, hurry and #C000246204go after her#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191584"
msgid "Well, most importantly, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came out fine. \nWe also got #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF out of the way.\nThings turned out alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191728"
msgid "So, what was it like inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191780"
msgid "I know.\nJust kidding. It was just a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191824"
msgid "It's normal to tease #[girls][boys]# you're interested in.\nYou've done it before, right, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191936"
msgid "You must be tuckered out after today.\n#C000246204How about going back to My Room and resting#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192036"
msgid "Me? Ahh, yeah.\nAfter I wrap this last thing up,\nI guess I'll hit the hay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192112"
msgid "I'll finish this up quick and\nhave myself that shower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192168"
msgid "Ah, before I forget. If by any chance you happen\nto peek or something, I'll mod all the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF exits to \"forbid egress\"鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192316"
msgid "You probably don't remember, but you have\na history of peeking around.\nA shock won't cut it this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192420"
msgid "If you'd like, how about we go in together?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192464"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I was\ntalking to #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192564"
msgid "Like hell I'm going to say it in front\nof other people!!! Especially in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192652"
msgid "When three girls get together to talk,\nit can only be about one thing, right?\nRomance, always romance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192756"
msgid "But both #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are clueless when\nit comes to that stuff… I'm not going to\nhassle them over it, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192904"
msgid "I was kind of hoping to see whose memory it\nwas about… Hmm, it feels like I got\nmy hopes up for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193012"
msgid "We know what causes her invincibility, but the\nway to destroy it is more than just difficult.\nWe may as well call it a gamble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193140"
msgid "Why's it gotta be invincibility, anyway!?\nShe better be putting up her wallet if she\nwants a pass on cheats like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193260"
msgid "This will be the last time we work together.\nYou'll enter #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind and beat her.\nThen you'll bust into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193428"
msgid "Just do what you always do and you'll win,\nno sweat. Don't get overeager, just stay cool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193520"
msgid "Now I'm kind of relieved.\nFeels like I'm overflowing with motivation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193592"
msgid "Yep, yep鷙\nMoney really does make the world go round!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193648"
msgid "Wh-what!?\nIt's no big deal―― I do like money, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193708"
msgid "Hehehehehe. Time to show us how slick\nof a#RUBS      Magus#RUBE#C000246204 negotiator#CDEF#REND you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193816"
msgid "If you have anything left to take care of,\ngo get it done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193880"
msgid "I guess all I have left to do is clean up\nthe Student Council Room and the room I've been\nusing. Then it's bedtime for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194004"
msgid "Alright, meeting adjourned.\nI'm in private mode now.\nWe'll pick this back up tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194092"
msgid "Oh?\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you're back in our old uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194152"
msgid "Hm? I don't have much to say about it.\nI've seen plenty of that uniform.\nBut… you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194244"
msgid "When I just sit and look you over, I think…\nNo, I thought this way before, too.\nYou're rather good looking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194356"
msgid "Ah, what am I even saying!? \nI have nothing to say, nothing!\nGo get your ass in that Labyrinth already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194460"
msgid "So you obtained new dust data.\nI'll begin decompressing it, then. A volume of\nthis size should take a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194576"
msgid "………………………decompression failed.\nAnd verification, complete.\nSo that's what it was, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194680"
msgid "The contents of the first cube was\na compressed version of the first Arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194756"
msgid "The contents of the second cube was\na compressed, special hostile program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194832"
msgid "It appears to be a skill which\ncompresses anything to its minimum, no matter\nhow large the volume is, and stores it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194952"
msgid "The issue is in, I think, that this compression\nis irreversible. Whatever data she compresses\ncan never return to its original form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195088"
msgid "The moment it gets compressed into a cube shape,\nthe data becomes garbage which merely\n\"was once that kind of data.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195208"
msgid "Though it's compressed, it can't be\ndecompressed. Though it's destroyed,\nit persists as it was before in form――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195324"
msgid "…this data, thrown away in the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, is a mass of information which we\ncan't comprehend from our point of view."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195468"
msgid "Is a person a person because they're in the\nshape of a person? If you gather up human parts,\na human's necessary materials, is it human?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195608"
msgid "Where does one put the soul, all the qualia?\n…if we put those questions aside… This\ncompression may be an instance of eternity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195740"
msgid "Those who are compressed by #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nare anchored for eternity, and are stowed away\nin a storage named the \"recycle bin.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195880"
msgid "What lies ahead for them is Hell, where they\nlive on, transformed into slices of flesh. That\nsuffering isn't perceivable to us, outside."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1196020"
msgid "Mystic Code \"#C000246204Dustcloud of Osiris#CDEF\""
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1196072"
msgid "added to the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196100"
msgid "Apologies for the wait.\nThe data #C236196003Archer#CDEF gave us has\nfinished decompressing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196192"
msgid "Since the folder is unnamed, we don't know whose\nmemory this belongs to… But this is an advanced\narchive file utilizing pseudo-Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196332"
msgid "If we open the folder, a patch will\nautomatically be applied on its owner.\nShall we open it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196428"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF was cautious about storing it, after all.\nThere's a high chance that there's a clue\nin it that will help us defeat her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196568"
msgid "P-please wait!\nYou can't go opening someone's \"memory\" when\nyou don't know who it belongs to――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196668"
msgid "There's nothing risky about it, right?\nIt's not as if someone else's memory is\ngoing to get overwritten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196776"
msgid "Overwriting memories that aren't yours to\nbrainwash someone is a huge endeavor.\nEven #C236196003BB#CDEF would need some time to pull it off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196920"
msgid "Simply opening the file and having the memories\nreturn to their owner won't matter. If they're\nfake, they'll bounce off of the soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197056"
msgid "Then I'll extract it.\nI believe it'll be relevant to either\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, or me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197192"
msgid "Close your eyes, relax your consciousness.\nAlright―― I'm opening it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197264"
msgid "I haven't discovered anything new, either.\nIt must have belonged to #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF then,\nI suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197384"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, please comment. If it's hard\nto speak aloud, or even if it's a memory of Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, feel free to write it down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197572"
msgid "I take issue with these two keenly peeping at me exclusively.\nAnyway, I don't feel very much different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197676"
msgid "…if I recall correctly, it was said during that\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF that the \"truth\" would be revealed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197788"
msgid "I see. Well, it'll become clear at some point,\nlike it or not. Don't worry about it,\njust keep exploring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197896"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is right.\nLet's get to doing what we can do right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197972"
msgid "…hm? I may just be imagining it,\nbut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF seems to be acting a little strange.\nShe looks pale and seems to be suppressing some chills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198128"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nYour thought-routines aren't stable.\nHas your accumulated #RUBS fatigue#RUBEdamage#REND not gone away?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198260"
msgid "…what was that?\nAs #C236196003Sakura#CDEF went to leave the Student Council Room,\nshe glanced at me as if to tell me something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198392"
msgid "Maybe she wants to tell me something in private?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198444"
msgid "…what's the matter?\nI don't think there's any more\nneed to speak to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198520"
msgid "…the old me wouldn't have suffered.\nIf I hadn't learned about the human mind,\nI would've maintained my own mental state――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198648"
msgid "…still need something?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1198672"
msgid "…no, it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198692"
msgid "…how about going to your room and\ngetting some sleep?\nYou look tired. We both do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198776"
msgid "Every #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF erases all NPCs\nand resets every AI's experiences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198896"
msgid "…let's see.\nMy guess is that so it won't deviate from how\nit should be as an observation machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198996"
msgid "In reality, it may be so that it avoids\ncases like the one we're in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199068"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is the eye of god. Within the\nCore is its storage medium, made of photons,\nwhich exists on a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199212"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF knows how to end humanity.\nHowever, it provides no evaluation of such\na result."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199332"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF doesn't say which choices lead to\na better future―― That is to say, it has no\ncriteria for evaluating good and bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199480"
msgid "That's exactly why it leaves humanity to manage\nthe Earth. No, it exclusively acts as an\noutsider that never intervenes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199604"
msgid "But, if an AI with a clear criteria were to\nenter it, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF may use it as a part\nof its intelligence and pick a better future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199756"
msgid "――Which would be the obliteration of humanity.\nIf they're ultimately going to go extinct,\nthen it should be done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199876"
msgid "Taking it as a decision that curbs the\nwaste of resources, I think it's\nextremely logical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199968"
msgid "So long as it's an AI that can't break from being rational,\nany AI would choose to \"purge the Earth of humans.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200080"
msgid "In #C236196003BB#CDEF's case, her method―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200124"
msgid "\"Collapse by way of human free will\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200164"
msgid "The result of all this is that what wasn't\nsupposed to be possible to happen did… Some\nfatal bug has occurred in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200312"
msgid "It's not that Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, you, or I were\ninadequate. Nor is it #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or #C236196003BB#CDEF's fault.\nThat bug is the cause of this destruction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200492"
msgid "Saying this, #C236196003Rani#CDEF then stops talking.\n…it looks like #C236196003Rani#CDEF is more defeated than #C236196003Rin#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200632"
msgid "It truly pains me to say this:\nit's impossible to analyze any further\nwith just Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and me alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200756"
msgid "Figures… So it's not going to be that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200804"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\" is a part of #C236196003BB#CDEF's matrix.\nIt's not likely that she would reveal her weaknesses so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200940"
msgid "It's thanks to the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF that we got part of that data.\nWe couldn't have done it on our own――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201060"
msgid "So please provide us with Sakurament.\nWith this many points,\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201168"
msgid "So it WAS that easy…!\nIt's a massive amount of points,\nbut it's enough to scrape together somehow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201268"
msgid "Look me in the eye, Darling!\nAs the keeper of our finances, I can't approve\nof such wasteful spending!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201372"
msgid "So money speaks loudest in the end, as usual.\n\"King of Heroes Money-is-Power system\"… hmph.\nHas a nice ring to it, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201500"
msgid "Hey! You stole that from me!\nThe Money-is-Power system is a #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF business!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201596"
msgid "It is what it is.\nWe simply don't have enough mechanical power.\nWe have to make up for where we fall short."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201704"
msgid "Haven't I said this before?\nMoney. Money makes the world go round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201772"
msgid "Have you gathered the Sakurament?\nThen please transfer it to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201840"
msgid "Wait, I don't have enough on hand.\nLet's come back once we earn #C00024620450,000 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201932"
msgid "Once you gather enough, please #C000246204come talk to me#CDEF.\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202044"
msgid "Please give me a few minutes.\nI swear on Isis, mother of magic,\nthat I will unveil #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1202156"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202200"
msgid "I don't see a way to block #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nbut I have an idea on how to counteract it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202300"
msgid "After analyzing #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nI acquired privileges from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nto access \"primordial powers.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202432"
msgid "#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF is the genesis of human history;\nthe dawn lighting over civilization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202532"
msgid "To summarize, it's an #ROFS0001#RUBS    origin#RUBEarchetypal#REND power from\nwhich human genes began.\nIt is inherent within every human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202676"
msgid "If they're equal in strength, then it\nmay prevent #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF ability to make things\n\"as if they never happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202808"
msgid "Hm? A Servant's primordial strength…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, you don't mean…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202888"
msgid "Primordial… One's origin, huh? The original\nform of a Heroic Spirit that even we have no\nknowledge of… No way. Really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203012"
msgid "Gehh!\n\"Primordial\" is referring to my\nsource material!? Oh boy, so that means…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203092"
msgid "Oh?\nSo you mean to involve my prototype?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203136"
msgid "Yes. Diving into a Servant's Cyber Frame and\ndirectly accessing their Heroic Spirit core will\nreveal their root, sealed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203292"
msgid "We'll unlock a \"#C000246204Mythological Mystic Code#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203352"
msgid "Going directly into a Heroic Spirit's core…\nLike when we did a mental dive into #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203460"
msgid "#[He][She]#'s going inside me!?\nJ-j-just one thing―who will protect\nPraetor if #[he][she]#'s inside me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203568"
msgid "Not to brag or anything,\nbut my red blood cells… rather, my sanitation\nprogram is vicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203660"
msgid "If you throw my adorable Praetor in there,\nI'm certain #[he][she]# won't last two seconds!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203752"
msgid "Diving into a Servant's digital frame…\nIt may be possible, but it comes with risk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203836"
msgid "So it really has come to this, huh?\nDarling is going to see this part and that part\nof my insides, goodness――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203948"
msgid "Hyaan, how embarrassing for #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204000"
msgid "Ha!? W-well, let's leave that aside for now!\nAs much as I LOVE my Darling, my sanitation\nprogram on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204120"
msgid "I don't have control as far down as the cells\nguarding my body. They won't recognize you as\nDarling; they'll try to harm an intruder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204256"
msgid "Now this is extraordinary. I won't deny you\nto experience my prototype… but with it\ncomes equal part risk, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204376"
msgid "Any body will have a sanitation system serving\nas the immune function. There are neither\nenemies nor allies there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204492"
msgid "…that's the one issue. While we can use #C000246204Multi-\nColored Tranquility#CDEF to send in #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF,\n#[his][her]# Servant won't be there for protection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204664"
msgid "I planned to include an escort doll to serve\nas a pseudo-Servant, but the doll doesn't\nhave very high stats…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204776"
msgid "…realistically, we can't. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is already\nutilizing memory beyond her limits to maintain\nthe old school building's systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204920"
msgid "Performing analyses is one thing, but we don't\nhave the spare memory to add a new,\nindependent function."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205028"
msgid "O-okay, that would do――\nW-wait, that won't change the fact that\nPraetor will be seeing my insides!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205132"
msgid "More importantly, under no circumstance\ncan I allow Praetor to contract with\nanyone but me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205224"
msgid "…makes sense.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF is a Servant deserving of full confidence.\nI need to prioritize my Master's safety."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205348"
msgid "…though, personally, I find it hard to\nagree to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205404"
msgid "T-this is a lot to take in… My instincts are\ntelling me to protect Darling, but I'm also\nthinking that I'm getting what I deserve."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205536"
msgid "I honestly don't like #[him][her]# contracting another\nServant, but #C236196003Karna#CDEF won't bother becoming a\nrival, I think, so I'll allow it this once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205696"
msgid "So, him… He certainly is competent.\nI have no objections to his\ndignity and strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205784"
msgid "But do not contract him, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nA trial contract should pose no issue, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205884"
msgid "What other choice do we have?\nYou'll have to work with it. We absolutely need\na buffed Servant to compete with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206016"
msgid "Same goes for you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nThis will be your second dive, so please\nprepare for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206116"
msgid "I know diving into a digital frame is dangerous,\nbut this is our last hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206192"
msgid "…yeah. Worst case, we can force her… but I\nwouldn't even bet on #C236196003#NICK#CDEF's\nlife that we could do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206308"
msgid "So… There is one thing we can try…\nShe'll definitely get on board if\nwe sell it well…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206400"
msgid "She doesn't seem to be referring to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206464"
msgid "Don't mind me, just thinking out loud.\nPlease go #C000246204convince Jinako#CDEF. She won't talk\nto anyone but you at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206596"
msgid "I'm not very confident that I can succeed\nin persuading her, but without #C236196003Karna#CDEF's help,\nit's too dangerous to dive into my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206744"
msgid "For now, let's go to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206804"
msgid "Now that #C236196003Rani#CDEF mentions it, I forgot about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206868"
msgid "In that case, I recommend gathering some\ninformation at the library."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206940"
msgid "He's one of many famous heroes of India's\nmythology… There should be detailed\ndescriptions of him in the #C000246204sacred Mahabarata#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207084"
msgid "Makes sense.\nKnowing that makes this a lot easier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207136"
msgid "Before going into the Relief,\nlet's stop by the #C000246204library#CDEF and investigate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207228"
msgid "It's good that you're safe, #[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI heard about what happened from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207356"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF's final moments, #C236196003BB#CDEF's goal…\nThe problems are piling up.\nWe mustn't lose heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207484"
msgid "We'll gather the resources we have left,\nand with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's aid, the Student Council\nwill unite to take measures against #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207640"
msgid "#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF… I was wavering over\nwhether to report this to you or not, but I'll\njust go ahead and tell you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207772"
msgid "About the #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF we discussed\npreviously: it's not something we programmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207876"
msgid "It's a gift #C236196003BB#CDEF gave us and put in the\nStudent Council Room. I suppose it's her\nway of provoking us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207992"
msgid "Before these \"seven days\" come to pass,\nlet's do whatever it takes to prevent #C236196003BB#CDEF from\nreaching the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208144"
msgid "Good day. This is the first time we've spoken\n#RUBS        this side#RUBEon the #REND#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208268"
msgid "…the first time, RIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208296"
msgid "My analysis of the dust data continues.\nThis data requires a massive amount of storage,\nso it seems its use will be limited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208424"
msgid "However… I know this is immodest,\nbut the decompression of this strange\n#RUBS              codec  #RUBEcompression information#REND makes my heart throb."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208580"
msgid "Although her abilities are unknown to us,\nwe can expect that she has considerable\nfirepower. Please be extra careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208700"
msgid "Good morning.\nIn this old school, it's evening\nall day long, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208768"
msgid "The damage done to the data wasn't my fault.\nI'm careful never to make mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208852"
msgid "I don't want to think about it, but it must\nhave something to do with a skill she possesses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208948"
msgid "I'm estimating it will be a 225% increase\nin security. It won't break even if an elephant\ncame crashing on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209060"
msgid "The most effective way to protect an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nis for the Sentinel to conceal themselves\nand never appear before you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209224"
msgid "Does she have unshakable confidence\nthat her #C000246204SG#CDEF can't be stolen…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209308"
msgid "…it's inexplicable. All I can think of is\nthat there's#RUBS     a bug#RUBE an issue#REND with\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's #RUBS subroutines#RUBEprinciples#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209472"
msgid "I completed a program that increases resistance\nto Instant Death. I already provided the\nCommissary with the necessary information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209604"
msgid "I also supplied it to the Commissary\nin order to simplify their process of\ngathering and mass productionizing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209716"
msgid "Please don't get me wrong. I don't think like\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF does. She would do something like \ncollude with Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF for profit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209880"
msgid "Great reviews at the Commissary, and there's a\nspecial going on―― No service fee!\nPlease be sure to purchase one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209996"
msgid "So, a pretend couple………………………\n…………………………………………\n………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210100"
msgid "………no, I don't really think anything\nof it. I expect this to turn out well.\nPlease go to hel… erm, do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210220"
msgid "Even if I recover my memories, no part of me\nwill fall out of order… but what about\neveryone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210320"
msgid "Now I know for sure. That my actions\nduring my time as a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF were\na temporary confusion, not my true self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210448"
msgid "That's because the subconscious doesn't surface.\nAlso, when one is a Labyrinth,\nthey're synchronized with #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210576"
msgid "An unwanted personality change happens,\nbasically. Yep, I think that's it.\nOtherwise these #C000246204SGs#CDEF couldn't possibly exist!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210712"
msgid "Ahhh. I must say, those were\nsome impressively dramatic changes\nthe two of you went through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210808"
msgid "Hohoho. Is #C236196003President Leo#CDEF running his mouth?\nPerhaps I should start setting off\nsome Atlas-style mustard bombs around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210948"
msgid "I agree with #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's suggestion for\na tea party. For humans to have a burst in\nperformance, they must be mentally satiated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211096"
msgid "A group whose leader demands 100% performance\nat all times has no future. Look no further\nthan history for proof of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211220"
msgid "What I'm saying is, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF is a leader\naccustomed to that performance, although I don't\nknow if that's from intent or from instinct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211376"
msgid "And so with that, I'll be polishing my tea-\nmaking skills in preparation for the coming day\nof our tea party. Please look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211516"
msgid "To be able to maintain one's ego without\nbeing influenced by instinctive desires and\nlaziness is a privilege of rational people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211648"
msgid "I just can't comprehend this statement\nfrom #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211724"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… She's a person that I\ncan't understand, but I CAN understand\nher righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211840"
msgid "She helps people without reward, without\nimposing her ideas. The ethics and social\nwelfare behind her ideology are wonderful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211968"
msgid "The truth is that many sick people and people\nat a low point in their lives are grateful\nto her. Truly a modern-day saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212092"
msgid "It's sad, but organizations out for profit\ntargeted her for that reason and labeled her\nas a cybercriminal――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212204"
msgid "Ah!? So that's it. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF dislikes her\nbecause it's a clash of the avaricious character\nversus the non-avaricious character…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212356"
msgid "I don't think any direct harm will come to us,\nbut bear in mind that #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF\ndoesn't have a normal mindset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212488"
msgid "Everyone puts themselves first.\nHowever, I believe that you're quite not\nso inclined to do so, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212608"
msgid "A bystander might praise that as hard\nto come by, but depending on the situation,\nit could be fatal. Please be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212728"
msgid "To be more specific, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's style was\nin desk work. Your style is in field work,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212872"
msgid "This may sound cruel, but you won't be allowed\nto rest, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. Please be ready\nfor more back-breaking work than ever before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213028"
msgid "You'll be fine. There's never been a single\nincident of a human being dying over food\ntasting bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213128"
msgid "The unarmed Shinji-boy――\nConsidering it was free software, it did a #RUBS  good job#RUBEGJ#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213228"
msgid "I gave it four stars on the store. I wasn't a\nfan of the avatar's design, so that was a minus.\nI'm looking forward to the next version."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213364"
msgid "Between my intervention with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's self-protect program, we're suppressing\nthe encroachment for the time being――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213532"
msgid "We don't know when she'll be breached.\nHurry, get the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213632"
msgid "――――I don't understand what that means.\nHowever, we're racing against time.\nPlease #C000246204get a hold of Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213768"
msgid "Have you gotten the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF?\nThen #C000246204speak to Miss Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213876"
msgid "Please leave the rest to us\nand get some rest, President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213936"
msgid "Even if we flex our technical muscles and apply\npatches to strengthen her, what will ultimately\nsave her is someone's #ROFS0003#RUBSheart#RUBEmind#REND――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214092"
msgid "It's not logical, but with how I am now,\nI feel elated that such is the case.\nPlease take care of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214240"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… One more #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nIt wouldn't be wrong to consider her as #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nlast bastion of defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214392"
msgid "However… She turned #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF into a virus,\ncast her out, and worse. #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's threat\nlevel is different than the other #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214576"
msgid "Once I gain more emotions, I think I'll send\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF a thank-you letter. Naturally, I'll\nthank her for teaching me what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214728"
msgid "And I deem that it's thanks to Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nthat I got this good at making jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214828"
msgid "I'm confident in how I shaped the decoys to\nuse against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. It's at a level where\nI could ship them out as official figurines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214980"
msgid "…I wasn't expecting those memories to not\nbelong to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215044"
msgid "In that case, where did that memory data\nend up going, I wonder?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215112"
msgid "She didn't modify herself, but rather,\nthe system. Quite a hacker's way of thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215200"
msgid "Without Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF here, a hacker on\nthe international most wanted list,\nwe likely wouldn't have realized it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215328"
msgid "We'll continue our analysis on how\nto overcome #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's #C000246204Invincibility#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215436"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's Relief…\nShe also possesses a weakness in her heart,\nsome trauma…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215532"
msgid "…no, this is not a good choice of\nperson to sympathize with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215596"
msgid "We've made it this far at great cost.\n#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF,\nplease prepare for the battle ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215708"
msgid "Our support is perfect now that we have more\nmechanical power, but convincing Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF\nis a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215840"
msgid "This is something that only you can pull off,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. We're counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215944"
msgid "You want to know what familiar Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nprepared for you? Sorry, she didn't tell me\nanything about it, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216076"
msgid "However, you should know better than anyone\nthat whatever Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF prepares always goes\nabove our expectations, #C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216244"
msgid "…well, more like diagonally above our\nexpectations, but that's what's\ncharming about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216336"
msgid "…ah, yes. It's been some time since I\nread the stars. Perhaps I'll do so.\nMay a good light shine over our battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216452"
msgid "Well, well.\nYou're wearing our uniform\nfrom the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216524"
msgid "I figured she would ask me this at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216572"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF say nothing about my judgement to me.\nBut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216704"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216764"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes me.\nShe did all of those things because she likes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216868"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216944"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217004"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nShe did all of those things because she likes him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217128"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1217204"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217224"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's eyes widen, and she's at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217292"
msgid "The short, actually, very long silence eventually breaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217352"
msgid "Erm, this is odd.\nI thought I wouldn't like the idea\nof being lumped together with them, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217448"
msgid "I feel relieved.\nIn any case, I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217504"
msgid "She is who she is, I am who I am.\nI'll support you until the very end.\nI'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217592"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I wish to speak with you in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217656"
msgid "Praetor. Please wait in the\ncorner of the room for us to finish.\nDon't move a muscle until I tell you to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217764"
msgid "…ahem.\nThere's only one thing to ask about:\nThe Psycho Dive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217828"
msgid "I'm not particularly afraid or anything,\njust a little uneasy.\nI'll be consulting you on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217924"
msgid "I could tell where the Presi…\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF was inside of me,\nbut it was mysterious, a new feeling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218036"
msgid "It felt like heat from a different source\nthan myself was racing through my nerves.\nIt was warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218136"
msgid "But, um… It felt like\nevery inch of my body was being looked at…\nEmbarrassment is one thing I felt plenty of…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218252"
msgid "T-that certainly is embarrassing!\nI learned much from this!\nYou have my thanks, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218356"
msgid "…ahem. Now then, my Praetor,\nlooking so glum up against that wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218424"
msgid "For no particular reason,\nI'm going to go take a little bath.\nWait for me here until I finish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218520"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Do you have a moment to spare?\nI have a brief thing I would like to speak\nto you about in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218644"
msgid "Ah, please go sit in that chair there, Darling.\nCount cherry petals in the schoolyard. Be like,\n\"aren't cherry trees in bloom so romantic?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218784"
msgid "…okay. There's only one topic to discuss:\nThe experience of your mental dive, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218872"
msgid "As you can imagine, I kind of don't have \nexperience with having my mind… or rather,\nmy body adventured in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218984"
msgid "What does it feel like? Does it actually hurt?\nIf it does, in what way? Like a cavity\nor a headache, something of that nature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219112"
msgid "This level of exposure\nis right up #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219180"
msgid "Now then, that's enough of our secret talk.\nDid I keep you waiting, Darling?\nOkay, let's go full speed ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219292"
msgid "Yeah. Although I'll be dormant during the dive,\nmy immune functions will still be working.\nDon't take detours, go straight for the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219432"
msgid "Fool. Don't speak as if your Spiritron makeup\nis anything equivalent to mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219512"
msgid "My flesh possesses the supreme Golden Rule.\nIt's the finest work of art on this entire\ncelestial body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219616"
msgid "To one who is ordinary, every part of me\nis a perilous poison. Go forth steeled,\nand try not to become charmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219728"
msgid "I called out to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as I went to hand over\nthe Classic Sailor Uniform I got a hold of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219836"
msgid "……but just as she turned around,\nI got a little nervous,\nwondering if I was just being presumptuous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219940"
msgid "No, no, no, it would be a complete waste to stop now.\n#[It's not like I'm going to wear a girl's uniform, anyways.][I don't need a second set of the same uniform anyway.]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220112"
msgid "I grasped the folded uniform tightly,\nresolved myself,\nand thrust the uniform in front of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220228"
msgid "\"I know this is sudden,\n but #[please take this][take this]#, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!\""
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1220316"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220364"
msgid "Since #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's an ally helping us escape from\nthe Far Side of the Moon,\nI absolutely want her to wear this uniform too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220500"
msgid "Please return it to #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF at once,\nand buy something else with it.\nLike a recovery item, or a Mystic Code!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220636"
msgid "It hurts to have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF reject it so profusely.\nI did expect her to be confused by it,\nbut I didn't expect her to say \"No.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220776"
msgid "Ah… T-that's not it…… I just meant\nthat we should keep an order of priorities\nbased on the situation…… so……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220892"
msgid "I don't want to inconvenience you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nSo it's not as if I don't like it,\nor anything like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221012"
msgid "I look up and say \"In that case……\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221052"
msgid "\"If you're really not opposed to the uniform, then――\n as an ally of the Student Council,\n and an ally who supports #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\n I definitely want you to wear it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221240"
msgid "\"It'll definitely look good on you, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221304"
msgid "………you're a curious person, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nNo one else seems to mind things like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221404"
msgid "……I understand. Since I need to change,\nwill you accompany me to the Infirmary?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221488"
msgid "I left the Student Council Room along with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221556"
msgid "What is it that you need?\n………wha――? You're giving me a uniform?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221628"
msgid "I am very grateful for your consideration,\nbut I cannot accept this\nunder the current circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221732"
msgid "This Sm belongs to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF……\nSo please put it towards\nexploring the Labyrinth instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221836"
msgid "……I know what #C236196003Sakura#CDEF just said isn't wrong.\nIf I didn't go out of my way to prepare this uniform,\nI wouldn't have run into as many issues as I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222004"
msgid "I did want to see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in the classic school uniform,\nbut I should give up on this for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222116"
msgid "She usually turns her head and gives me a smile,\nbut she was gazing somewhere far off, looking depressed.\nIt seems as if she hasn't noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222260"
msgid "Growing concerned, I try calling out to her again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222312"
msgid "It's rare for the hard working #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to be so sluggish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222388"
msgid "Which reminds me, when I was diving into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nLabyrinth Core, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF helped me out as well.\nCould that have been really taxing on her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222560"
msgid "No structural defects exist\nin AI who are products of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nHowever, #C236196003BB#CDEF appeared――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222688"
msgid "…I see. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF are identical models.\nIf #C236196003BB#CDEF did go rogue, that means it could happen with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222860"
msgid "For humans, no one could use \"because they're human\" as\na reason to say that another person and I are the exact same.\nFor those two AI, it's different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223012"
msgid "No matter how different they are on the inside,\nas long as they were made from the same design,\nthe same outcome would be possible for both…\nShe must've realized that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223184"
msgid "But this really isn't something she needs to worry about.\nThe cause for her going rogue is most likely a bug, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223304"
msgid "As a comrade in the Student Council, as our ally,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is protecting the health of everyone in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223432"
msgid "In our last meeting,\neveryone must have confirmed as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223492"
msgid "Yes. I was truly happy\nafter hearing everyone's words back then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223560"
msgid "…but I can't ignore the chance of a defect\nlying within me as much as you all trust me.\nI can't say for sure that a bug won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223696"
msgid "When I think about how, by some catalyst,\nI may end up like #C236196003BB#CDEF, I wonder if staying here\nis the right choice or―aahh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223832"
msgid "I aim for the defenseless #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's forehead,\nand let loose a light karate chop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223928"
msgid "A critical hit! Sakura has been stunned!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223972"
msgid "Supposing that #C236196003Sakura#CDEF doesn't trust herself, everyone else DOES.\nBefore thinking about the \"worst case scenario,\"\nI want her to turn to the words of her comrades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224152"
msgid "Plus, if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF were to ever go rogue like #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF would do\neverything in #[his][her]# power to stop #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224336"
msgid "I spoke pridefully to my kouhai,\n\"I'll karate chop you over the brow until you cry,\n so don't worry so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224448"
msgid "…yes, you're right. I have everyone by\nmy side, and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF even comes to visit me\nto see how I'm doing, like now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224584"
msgid "I won't make mistakes.\nI don't expect them to happen.\nI won't become #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224676"
msgid "I put my strength into a solid nod at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224752"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and I won't let that happen.\nSo… someway, somehow, I want her to feel at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224876"
msgid "…yes! To make sure the trust\neveryone's put in me won't be in vain,\nI'll keep trying my very, very best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224984"
msgid "Yeah. Now that that's settled, I can't be\nstanding here daydreaming. I have to return to\nthe Student Council Room now. Yes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225108"
msgid "I had #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF wait in the classroom because\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# was a little hard on the eyes… erm,\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# looks different from what you're used to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225328"
msgid "Waking up from a long sleep is mentally\ndraining enough for you, so I had them wait\nsomewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225428"
msgid "…um.\nAnyway, please don't be surprised, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225476"
msgid "About #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―― He was looking all around\nthe old school building and\nwouldn't listen to me at all――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225600"
msgid "Y-you're asking about money?\nI'm sorry. I wish to help you in\nas many ways as I can, but……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225696"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not pay any wages.\nThus I am, one could say, penniless…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225788"
msgid "And the Labyrinth's value of currency……\nits excess memory is different than what's\non the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225904"
msgid "I wonder what it is about the name \"Sakurament.\"\nFor some reason, it feels incredibly malicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226004"
msgid "Um, how about collecting some locally?\nM-manual labor is a wonderful thing, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226092"
msgid "You want to know where #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is?\nUmm, please give me a second to look him up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226188"
msgid "…huh? He's not in the hallways.\nThere's two signals in the Janitor's Closet…\nBut isn't that where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226316"
msgid "I'll be assisting everyone from here on out.\nSpecifically, as an OS that executes and\nsupports #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's operations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226456"
msgid "Currently, I'm using root to also serve as\nthe main CPU that makes up the old\nschool building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226552"
msgid "In case of an emergency, I'll open the\nInfirmary right back up if anyone needs it.\nSo please don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226660"
msgid "As a health management AI, I'm against\nyou entering the cherry blossom tree, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226744"
msgid "Hee hee, I'm a pretty lousy nurse.\nI ended up concluding that you're all making\nthe right decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226844"
msgid "I won't cut any corners while supporting you.\nI'll do my best to try and be as\nhelpful to everyone as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226956"
msgid "How did you like My Room?\nIf anything inconveniences you,\nplease tell me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227036"
msgid "Me? No issues in the slightest.\nThis boost to my analytic functions actually\nhas me feeling in tip-top shape!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227148"
msgid "Asking about my destabilized emotional values?\nThank you for your concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227224"
msgid "But there's no need to worry.\nSince my optimization program is running,\nI'll adapt to the changes soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227336"
msgid "When we're installing new software,\nthis sort of thing happens more often\nthan you'd think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227428"
msgid "You want to know about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF? As far\nas I know, she hasn't taken a single step\noutside of the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227560"
msgid "So I don't have any new information on her.\nMy apologies……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227624"
msgid "How did it go with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\n*sigh*… She really won't leave the\nJanitor's Closet, will she…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227732"
msgid "The custodial room is similar to My Room for\nyou, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. But since it's in an\nalmost offline state, I worry a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227868"
msgid "To think such a large wall could exist…\nthis would never happen on the Near Side…\nso what's going on with this Labyrinth…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227996"
msgid "And, umm……\nIt's a lot more, organic and――\nbizarre, than it needs to be……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228076"
msgid "Wha―― You're going inside the Relief?\nThat's unknown territory.\nIs this really going to be okay…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228180"
msgid "……no. Even if safety isn't guaranteed,\nthis is not a situation where we can afford\nto let that stop us. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228304"
msgid "…you need to quickly ask about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's plan…\nThis is an important task, so I will not\nallow you to fail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228428"
msgid "However, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF has nothing with him. I can't\nscan the entirety of the Labyrinth, so I'm\nworried…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228544"
msgid "Anyway, rescuing #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is our highest priority\nright now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228620"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's previous outfit… There should be\nsome material on it around here… Hehe.\nI'm starting to feel a little excited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228756"
msgid "Good morning.\nIt looks like there's no meeting this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228820"
msgid "Sorry, I wasn't able to prepare anything else.\nPlease be careful during your search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228908"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, if you ever feel tired,\nthen please take a break.\nHow about having some tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229012"
msgid "It would be nice to know what #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes…\nBut I don't currently have any data\non her to infer from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229132"
msgid "Regardless, I can't believe I was the fastest\nto lose among us… I'm a disgrace as an AI…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229224"
msgid "Ahahaha. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is a little cruel, huh?\nEven though she's our enemy this time around,\nI sympathize with #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229368"
msgid "If I were #C236196003Rani#CDEF, I'd direct the school's\ntrash disposal towards the Janitor's Closet\nand do everything I could to open it up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229512"
msgid "I can still confirm signs of Masters and\nNPCs within the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229580"
msgid "I'm unable to measure the Relief's interior, but\nthere's no mistake that we must win against #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nin battle to free them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229720"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229768"
msgid "Hurry, #C000246204go before the Relief#CDEF. We'll also be\nadvancing our setup for the #RUBS     spiral #RUBEdepth descent#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229900"
msgid "I was a bit overloaded\nand my processing speed fell,\nso I had taken a break in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229996"
msgid "Ah, I'm fine now. I'm able to exhibit\n100% performance, so please don't worry\nabout a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230092"
msgid "I'm fine now. I'm operating completely normally.\nPlease leave the backup to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230172"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are beings born from rogue AI.\nThe likelihood of their basic structures\nbeing malfunctioned are high."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230304"
msgid "Thus, even if they appear normal at a glance,\nplease don't ever let your guard down.\n…these girls are obstacles we must defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230436"
msgid "There are others with the same model as me,\nbut I have no \"sister\" machines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230516"
msgid "But when I'm looking at #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I sometimes\nimagine… if this is what having\nan older sister is like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230632"
msgid "Although it's unclear as to why I feel that way.\nMaybe the cause is because #C236196003Rin#CDEF is so caring\nthat I started to depend on her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230776"
msgid "I can tell by looking at your face, I don't\neven need to scan it. I AM an apprentice\nin health management AI, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230900"
msgid "Of course, I didn't forget about\nbringing supplies! Okay, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230976"
msgid "The Student Council can back you up physically,\nbut we can't give care for mental fatigue.\nPlease take care of your body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231100"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF…\nA constitution that inclines one towards\nacts of torment after seeing her, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231224"
msgid "…it doesn't make much sense to me.\nI wonder why #C236196003BB#CDEF would add that sort of\ndefect to her own offshoot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231344"
msgid "…my assumptions were too optimistic.\nNow I'm going to tighten the entrance's\nsecurity up more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231452"
msgid "Even if #C236196003BB#CDEF herself tried, I won't let\nanyone invade this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231540"
msgid "But I raised the density due to this incident.\nEven if an enemy were kitten-sized, anything,\nincluding their body, would be repelled back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231680"
msgid "It involves signals rather than a body, and\nwhile we're within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, the Spiritron\nNetwork can't be cut even if we wanted to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231832"
msgid "………ah… I-I'm sorry.\nI was a little out of it.\nIs there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231920"
msgid "…sorry, I lost myself for a second there.\nWell, two people is safer than one… I wasn't\nsurprised or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232040"
msgid "Sorry for making you worry yesterday.\nI took my time debugging overnight,\nnow I'm up and ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232144"
msgid "About your memories…\nUm, I know everyone is having a hard time\nright now, but keep being careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232244"
msgid "It's going to be okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWe'll definitely get back the memories\nyou still don't have yet, soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232364"
msgid "Black tea, black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232388"
msgid "With or without your memories,\nI think that it doesn't change\nwho you are, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232472"
msgid "I spoke to just about every Master during\nthe 1st Round of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut I never got to speak with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232624"
msgid "She was confined in the Janitor's Closet the\nentire time. That door transforms into the\nArena's entrance after the preliminaries end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232760"
msgid "…we're almost there, aren't we?\nThis will all be over soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232824"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you.\nLet's escape from the Labyrinth this time,\nfor sure. That will lead to #C236196003BB#CDEF's deletion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232976"
msgid "Black tea mixed with coffee, plus sugar and\nmilk. That's an extra order I got from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\nOh! And the lemon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233104"
msgid "He'll be in tip-top shape to provide\nbackup on his side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233164"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you seem tired.\nPlease go back to your My Room\nand have yourself a long rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233268"
msgid "I still have plenty of medicine, so please\nlet me know if you run out. It may only serve\nas a small solace, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233384"
msgid "You're always acting reckless, after all,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Please be sure to rest\nwhen it's time for a break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233504"
msgid "Um, this might… not help wash away the taste,\nbut I tried making a bento for you.\nPlease eat it if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233616"
msgid "I hope it's to your liking…\nI'll be making lots more so I can hand out\nsome to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF next."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233748"
msgid "Doing things like exchanging bentos will\ndefinitely liven up the place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233820"
msgid "I thought all it would do is put your mind at\nease, but it worked better than I\nthought it would. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233928"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234108"
msgid "I have to go see #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and figure out a way to solve this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234184"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234364"
msgid "Let's go after #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nIf she's going to be anywhere,\nmaybe she'll be around the deepest part of the\nSakura Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234500"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234680"
msgid "Let's enter #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's subconscious and\ncut out the bits eating away at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234772"
msgid "Well of course. She's an AI gone rogue.\nShe seems logical, but she's holding on to\nchronic #RUBS    lag #RUBEemotions#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234896"
msgid "Things normal AIs would consider as fluctuating\nand cut out, she holds on to forever…. \nFrom the start, something was wrong with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235032"
msgid "…s-sorry…\nI find it difficult to speak when I look\nyou in the eyes now, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235116"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put this… I don't know\nthe reason why, but my chest feels warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235204"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235272"
msgid "I'll take charge of getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nto rest before they grow exhausted.\nPlease let me take care of things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235416"
msgid "Huh? Why are you laughing?\n\"I'm pretty dependable, oddly enough\"?\nY-you think so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235500"
msgid "Welcome back. Did you forget something?\nWe have our system to back you up all set to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235592"
msgid "To also double as thanks for saving me from the\nMelt Virus earlier, I put in a little extra\neffort! Please use it on your companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235728"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are trying their hardest,\nbut please be very careful in the Labyrinth,\nokay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235852"
msgid "…there's less than a 10% chance of success,\nbut we have to do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235920"
msgid "Even after the building's power shuts off,\nI'll be able to handle your Navi on my own,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236032"
msgid "I can only do so much, but please let me\nhelp you until the end.\nIt's also my duty to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236128"
msgid "Exploring the eighteenth floor comes first, yes?\nLet's not get distracted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nCore, lest we ignore what's before us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236276"
msgid "…I want to step up in turn.\nNo matter what happens on the final floor,\nI'll definitely protect you, Senpai…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236388"
msgid "I know I did something unforgivable, but…\nI want to do my best for you,\nof my own volition――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236484"
msgid "I have no more hesitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236512"
msgid "If you choose the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, where you\nmight perish, over this tranquil yet\nempty old school building, then――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236648"
msgid "A way to disable the #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236700"
msgid "Until we find a way, I won't open my Relief\nfor you. Please think of it as the bare\nminimum before facing #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236828"
msgid "If we can do it, then I also want\neveryone to return to the normal world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236904"
msgid "…huh?\nYou'd like some supplies for tomorrow, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236960"
msgid "…huh?\nYou say the last thing you want is to have some\nof my bento? And you'll pay handsomely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237056"
msgid "…oh, you. In terms of healing,\nelixirs are more effective and\nefficient, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237140"
msgid "Hee hee… I was planning on giving you some\nregardless if you pleaded me or not. I've been\ngiving out supplies for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237268"
msgid "Senpai, please stay safe tomorrow.\nGet plenty of rest tonight and clear your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237352"
msgid "Tomorrow is when we finally reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF. Please get plenty\nof rest tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237460"
msgid "Those clothes… That's the uniform from\nback in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237556"
msgid "It couldn't have been that long ago,\nbut I feel very nostalgic looking at those."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237640"
msgid "Changing clothes every now and then makes\nfor a nice change of pace, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237724"
msgid "The surviving Masters gathered in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237784"
msgid "The only ones not present are #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nwho's shut up in the Janitor's Closet, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237884"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, who joined the Student Council on his own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237952"
msgid "Huh? That #C236196003Gatou#CDEF guy isn't here?\nRight about now he'd be the first to start\nhowling, wouldn't he?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238068"
msgid "That old-timer took off just a bit ago.\nI tried looking for him too,\nbut he wasn't even in the restroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238176"
msgid "It's not like I ever got his personality,\nanyway. Maybe he's behind the school and away\nfrom the cameras, training or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238308"
msgid "Waah! The hell is this transmission!?\nAnd anyway, who is this otaku? Where'd this\nthird rate character pop out of?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238424"
msgid "Hey #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF――Same as ever, I see～\nYou really should ditch that habit of yours,\ncondescending all over people you just met."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238576"
msgid "That's why everyone over at PJ calls you\n\"Super Champ (LOL),\" \"Attention Whore (LMAO),\"\nand \"Kelp Head (ROFL).\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238688"
msgid "It always ends up like that for you～\nTake this as a condescending warning\nfrom #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238792"
msgid "Nyahaha! You're too kind, too kind.\nDon't expect me to give you any goodies for\nyour praise～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238888"
msgid "Play time equals proof of being a winner.\nEvery gamer knows that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238956"
msgid "You're just a no-lifer! It hasn't been a year\nsince FA released―that's about 18 hours a day!\nWhat school grade are you even in!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239088"
msgid "Not tellin'～ #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF's a no-life who\neven forgot how to sleep since\nI'm leveling up even in my sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239208"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is thoughtlessly snapping at the\ntransmission from #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239308"
msgid "If I recall correctly, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF was the Game Champ of Asia.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF also seems to be a game enthusiast,\nand both of them have some sort of connection\nfrom before they came to the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239524"
msgid "Excuse me. I found this a bit strange, but―\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, are you acquainted with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239640"
msgid "I am. The old-timer visits the Janitor's Closet\nrelatively often. I can't stand how loud he is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239736"
msgid "…though, I never let him in―even once.\nHe brought me some sweets, so I at least lent\nhim an ear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239836"
msgid "Is that so? It worries me that he won't respond\nto our calls, but let's focus on listening\nto Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239968"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. Although we witnessed what\nhappened, please explain it to us in detail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240072"
msgid "About what you did once you woke up\nand about that #C000246204dark girl#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240152"
msgid "Ahem.\nBefore I do, I'll apologize―more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240204"
msgid "Her actions were more or less to be expected,\nbut at the end of the day, #C236196003Rin#CDEF didn't harm us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240316"
msgid "\"The money stuff aside, don't worry about\nhaving been an enemy,\" I replied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240392"
msgid "There's no need to worry about it, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nI've always believed in you.\nI expected this outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240512"
msgid "I thought you were a spoiled, rich kid;\nan elitism fanatic; a horrible prick at\nheart, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240608"
msgid "Yes. I always believed you would be all bark\nand no bite, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. I saw this heartless\nspew of yours from a mile away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240752"
msgid "Hey! Just what part of me were you\nbelieving in!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240804"
msgid "What's this feeling?\nSomething warm is welling up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240868"
msgid "A real passion was hidden behind that remark of\n\"I believe in you, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240968"
msgid "Agh, enough! You are my enemy after all!\nI was stupid to be moved by your words for\neven a second!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241068"
msgid "Oh? Now that's a crying shame. If Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nwere to be moved by me, it would be that much\nharder to win the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241228"
msgid "Hmph. Keep talking, you cold-blooded man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241272"
msgid "Now then, I'll introduce myself again.\nI'm #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, one of the masters in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF who was captured by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241444"
msgid "However, I don't remember very well how far I\nmade it in the final selections or what\nhappened at that time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241556"
msgid "What I do remember is about getting attacked by\nthe Black Noise and having my consciousness\nfiddled with by #C236196003BB#CDEF after that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241696"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said this: \"If you maintain the Labyrinth\nthe way it is now, I'll grant any wish\nyou have.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241808"
msgid "Once I realized what happened, my mind became\nvery obedient to her, and I started acting like\nthe boss of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241932"
msgid "The rest is as you all know. I teamed up with\nred #C236196003Lancer#CDEF and became the proprietor of\nthe Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242052"
msgid "I feel like I got hints of all the things that\nhappened when I became the proprietor, but…\nsorry. I can't remember them either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242184"
msgid "It's like, rather than having forgotten it,\nI feel like I never \"put it to memory\" to\nbegin with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242284"
msgid "Like an external hard drive. While that AI was\nconnected, it dominated her and simultaneously\npulled information she had."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242408"
msgid "But now that the connection has been severed,\nthough she may be free, the AI's knowledge\ncan't be shared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242516"
msgid "That would mean the Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF from before\nwas both #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF AND the #C000246204dark AI's offshoot#CDEF\n…if I'm not mistaken?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242680"
msgid "…yeah, great example.\nHowever, I think that's exactly right. I was\na perfect little puppet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242776"
msgid "That culprit who imprisoned us all here;\nThat AI who destroyed the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――\nIs #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242904"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's explanation was mostly what I expected it to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242976"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF was also attacked in the final selections\nand pulled into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nThe biggest part of what #C236196003Rin#CDEF forgot was about\nhow that dark female AI―#C236196003BB#CDEF―captured and deployed her\nas the boss of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243260"
msgid "Now, #C236196003Rin#CDEF has also returned to us, back to her \nnormal self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243336"
msgid "She may have lost her power as the Labyrinth boss\nand doesn't have a Servant,\nbut having her excellent prowess as a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND\non our side is reassuring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243536"
msgid "So now, the next topic of discussion is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243584"
msgid "Eyes gather on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243624"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF had the same face as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nObviously, there's some relationship\nbetween them as AIs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243748"
msgid "We need to investigate the truth as\nto whether #C236196003BB#CDEF is the cause behind all this or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243852"
msgid "I'll ask you plain and simply, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nJust who is that AI girl? As far as we saw on\nthe screen, she had the same face as you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243996"
msgid "That's… that's an identical model, as me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244040"
msgid "An identical model… An identical model of\nmanagement type AI, which transmits information\non Masters to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF… is that it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244192"
msgid "Since plenty of NPCs are also identical models\nto one another, you having an identical model\ndoesn't sound that strange, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244320"
msgid "…I get it. If she's the same model as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nwho reports data to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, then she\nhas a free passcode to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244500"
msgid "Anyway, that's what we're up against.\nThat management AI went berserk and messed\nup our #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244620"
msgid "Is that reasonable to conclude, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244676"
msgid "…yes. I have no grounds to refute it.\nI don't know what caused this to happen,\nbut it's definitely as you say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244788"
msgid "That management AI… #C236196003BB#CDEF's objective is unknown,\nbut I agree that she's the culprit behind\npulling you all and us NPCs to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244940"
msgid "That said, um… I truly apologize for this,\nbut I just don't have the power\nor the authority to stop her…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245048"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is the embodiment of #RUBS   cheating#RUBEillegality#REND.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, who conforms to the rules,\ncan't stop #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245208"
msgid "She could've potentially always been that sort\nof AI. Like, if something sneaky happens in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'd pop out like the police."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245368"
msgid "A super law enforcer sorta person. If there's\na malicious player cheating, every participant\ngets deleted―that sorta thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245496"
msgid "Yeah, that's right.\nGood stuff, you no-life player.\nYou catch on quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245568"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does rebuke Masters about rule\nviolations, but the rules themselves have\nnever been broken before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245700"
msgid "To encroach on the entire school,\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's stage… no AI exists\nthat could authorize that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245820"
msgid "And firstly, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not create AI\nwith such cyclopean calculative capacity.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is an AI which mustn't exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245976"
msgid "…seems so. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a monster of\ncontrol. It probably wouldn't create something\ncapable of turning against it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246112"
msgid "That AI… #C236196003BB#CDEF―maybe we need to look at her\nas having fell out of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's control\ndue to a coincidental bug."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246260"
msgid "And then, she chose to augment her functions by\n#RUBS an algorithm#RUBEa thinking#REND based on her own judgement… likely\none for optimizing her survival and duties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246428"
msgid "That's the method for a storage capacity's\nstrengthening and intake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246500"
msgid "I've concluded that #C236196003BB#CDEF disassembles Servants and\nNPCs, and by using them as her memory, she grows\nin to an \"even more advanced AI.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246648"
msgid "An AI that's not being managed has no #RUBSrestraint#RUBElimits#REND.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has been capturing Masters over and over,\nsinking them into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246840"
msgid "We've been stored as further additions to that\nwoman's memory, but thanks to this old school,\nwe survived, narrowly… Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246980"
msgid "…#C236196003Julius#CDEF' hypothesis sends shivers down my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247048"
msgid "She assimilates servants as\n\"additional storage capacity\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247108"
msgid "No animal on the surface could do this.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, though, composed of\nelectrons and Spiritrons, could actually do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247248"
msgid "Hold on a second! That means she's going to\nkill us and make parts out of us!?\nTh-that's just plain murder, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247368"
msgid "Some damn AI thinks it can defy humans?\nThis has to be a joke, yeah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247440"
msgid "…on the surface it would be. However, this is\nthe Moon. The Three Laws in which AI obey humans\nhaven't been established here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247568"
msgid "Correct. The only laws that apply to us are\n[to properly manage the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF] and\n[to fulfill our given duties]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247700"
msgid "Since I'm the health management AI for all the\nMasters, under those laws I will protect you\nall. However… it's different for other AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247836"
msgid "If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF considered you all \"pointless\"\none day, they would likely try to delete you all\nwith efficiency―for management's sake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247992"
msgid "Wh… what are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248020"
msgid "Are you saying that, if we were out of the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's sights, then AI and NPCs would be\nour enemies…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248140"
msgid "…………I don't know. Not just among AI,\nbut also among NPCs there are individuals who\nare discontent with humans―I hear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248264"
msgid "That's because―\nThey have no \"reason\" to go so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248320"
msgid "Even if they had discontent, such a thing only\ncauses their emotion values to waver. It\nwouldn't… lead to such devilish conduct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248452"
msgid "If we let #C236196003BB#CDEF run loose, she'll assimilate\nNPCs and Servants #C001246204without rhyme or reason#CDEF――\nand in the end, she'll go for the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248636"
msgid "That will lead to the collapse of the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Before that happens―――\nsomeone has to stop #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248772"
msgid "…I see. Rather than going on a rampage,\nit would be appropriate to say that she's\nmalfunctioning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248872"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF seeks to expand her functions… Though it\ncould also be a form of self-preservation,\nshe no longer chooses methods for that end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249020"
msgid "No, it's more like, \"she can no longer choose.\"\nShe looks a lot like a human, but she's an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249116"
msgid "This means that she's become a machine who only\nchooses the most efficient methods to damage her\nethical functions, designed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249276"
msgid "This situation is completely beyond the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's expectations; an incident outside\nof its calculations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249400"
msgid "…beyond expectations, outside calculations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249448"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF said that here, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's eyes can't see us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249588"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF didn't assume such abnormal events would occur,\nand it still can't observe said abnormalities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249716"
msgid "It didn't expect this to be possible, it can't even detect it.\nBasically――We're not going to be rescued by the system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249840"
msgid "You're telling us to pull some magic out of\nour asses!? I don't even have a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249928"
msgid "Ohh? Are you lonely there, #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF?\nHey? Does this mean that I, having a Servant,\nam one of the winners? I'm a winner, yeah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250080"
msgid "That Servant's being wasted though.\nThe only Masters here that can handle a fight\nright now are #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250224"
msgid "Nah, I don't feel like going out to fight.\nPlease don't consider me as usable\nfighting power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250320"
msgid "Huh? What the hell are you saying? You plan on\nhiding that Servant we'll be needing? Aren't\nyou all about cooperating right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250452"
msgid "…ah, that's what you mean. Certainly, it would\nbe better if #C236196003Leo#CDEF doesn't go first. It's\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF's job to be the vanguard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250604"
msgid "True. Splendid, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. You catch on\nquick, and you're wily. If you were in my shoes,\nyou would do the same, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250744"
msgid "―――Hmph. You flatter me. I'm not the\nslightest bit happy about it, but I'll just say\ngood work, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250876"
msgid "Why are you praising him? This shark #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nis hiding his Servant so he can crush\nthe final selections!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250996"
msgid "This guy never had any intention of hiding to\nbegin with. Not fighting now is one type of\ntactic. It's a sort of, \"Golden Move.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251128"
msgid "An opponent would think of a way to block a\ntrump card as bold as #C236196003Leo#CDEF. But if that trump\ncard isn't shown, there's no need for a plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251280"
msgid "He'll conserve #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's Noble Phantasm until\nthe most crucial moment―――Does that sound\nabout right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251400"
msgid "Excellent. Splendid as always, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nI really will have to leave the Vice President\nseat to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251524"
msgid "…you really are set on making me a part of\nyour group. I'm only here to make up for the\ntrouble I caused when I was your enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251656"
msgid "Oh?\nNot satisfied as Vice President?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251696"
msgid "It's fine. I have no problem with being\nVice President. I wanted to try acting like a\nstudent anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251800"
msgid "And #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF is on General Affairs, right?\nAs part of your job in the Student Council,\nyou'll listen to our requests, yeah?鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251940"
msgid "Of course. Since, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's skill in \nhandling errands exceeds even that of myself,\nthe President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252056"
msgid "I wouldn't be so happy having THAT skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252100"
msgid "So―now that we understand the situation,\nlet's go over our plan from henceforth\none more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252196"
msgid "In order for us, the surviving Masters, to\nreturn to the Near Side of the Moon, we need\nto break through the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252340"
msgid "We'll have #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF head out first as the\nvanguard. We, in the Student Council,\nwill back #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252476"
msgid "Naturally, #C236196003BB#CDEF―who dragged us into the Far\nSide―will try to obstruct us, but we'll combine\nour strength and repel her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252612"
msgid "Broadly speaking, that's all.\nDoes anyone have any questions or objections?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252688"
msgid "I have no objections, of course.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF's plan is easy to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252768"
msgid "But… when this all goes down, what will\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252836"
msgid "She's an AI of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nSince she's serving to manage the health\nof the Masters, she's our ally for now―\nBut wouldn't opposing #C236196003BB#CDEF, an identical model,\nconflict with her duties…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253056"
msgid "I… want to be helpful to you all. Since #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand I are identical models, you might not\ntrust me, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253180"
msgid "There's no need to worry about that, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYour moral circuits are holding steady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253284"
msgid "I guarantee that as an AI, you have a\nhigh standard of perfection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253352"
msgid "That's right. Now that I think about it,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is the reason we're able to\nuse this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253468"
msgid "Without #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, we might have been expelled into\nthe imaginary number space and vanished into\nfoam by now. I believe #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and trust her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253640"
msgid "I guess so. Our #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here has a dopey face\nand doesn't seem capable of doing something\nstrategic like backstabbing us, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253784"
msgid "Got a Rare～♪ …uh, what's with this tension?\nDo I trust #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or not? Hrrmm.\nEven if you ask, I don't got much to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253924"
msgid "Hmm. As long as there's no trouble in the\nJanitor's Closet, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's got no hate for 'em.\nAlso, I like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's misfortunes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254084"
msgid "There ya have it. I'll also be reassured having\nher by our side. It kind of seems like she\nhelped us a lot in the Near Side too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254216"
msgid "Everyone… thank you very much. I'm happy.\nI'll show you all by doing the best I can, okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254308"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF eyes well up, and she gives us all a bow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254376"
msgid "…she's an AI just like #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nIn light of these events, she must have been\nprepared to be treated as an enemy.……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254508"
msgid "Similarly, I was anxious about whether\neveryone would expel #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or not as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254608"
msgid "But all that worry was just in my head,\nand it's over now. I feel relieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254684"
msgid "This voice―――!\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, how's our connection to the outside?\nIs it warded properly!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254784"
msgid "As long as you function through a network, no\nperfect security will ever exist. That's why…\nI can come along and do something like this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254924"
msgid "Okay! Are you all ready to applaud? I'm going\nto take all you good and bad kids, wrap you up\ninto little candies, and re-ship you off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255060"
msgid "To everyone in front of the monitor―\nGood evening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255112"
msgid "It's time for the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's most highly viewed\nand popular content: #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255228"
msgid "The host is everyone's antagonist imp: #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255288"
msgid "The viewers are all of the sad little sheep\nshut inside the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255360"
msgid "You there, with the kelp-looking hair.\nNothing will come of kicking and screaming,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255456"
msgid "You can't close your eyes.\nYou can't plug up your ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255512"
msgid "This is a brain-shaking nightmare liable to\nsnatch you away from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255588"
msgid "That's right! Once it starts, you have to\nwatch until the end: a roller coaster movie!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255676"
msgid "Hehe. I'm so eager to please that it makes\nme blush, if I say so myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255752"
msgid "Wha… what's going on!?\nOne second I'm in the Student Council Room,\nand now I'm in a studio."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255848"
msgid "Actually, rather than being in a studio,\nI'm seeing a studio."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255912"
msgid "There's nothing else around but that.\nI can't see my own hands and feet,\nlet alone #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and the others.\nIt's like I've been turned into a camera…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256100"
msgid "Ah. I'm not permitting questions either.\nSince only #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF-senpai has\nspeaking rights―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256208"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and the rest of you, please\nstay quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256292"
msgid "Now then. In today's #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, I'll be\nexplaining the basic rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256380"
msgid "Today's topic: \"How can we make our escape!?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256428"
msgid "Hey everyone, you want to know, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256468"
msgid "Silly me was so amused by Senpai's amazement,\nI ended up playing around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256544"
msgid "In the middle of the studio,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF giggles with a smile on her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256628"
msgid "…however, she just said something terrible.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF said, \"I was planning to finish off #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256752"
msgid "Though from the tone of her voice,\nit could also be taken as a joke…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256824"
msgid "That was no joke. That girl is serious.\nThere's no laughter in those eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256900"
msgid "…her eyes hold no laughter, I see.\nThat dark-colored #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… hmm… #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF?\nShe was seriously intent on killing #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257072"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be a jest. That woman's\nexistence itself is strange, but the whirlpool\nof madness within her is genuine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257196"
msgid "That woman―――Her body retains the appearance\nof a person, but it's already become a deadly\npoison, worse than #RUBS slime#RUBEfilth#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257340"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257424"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257508"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257592"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257676"
msgid "Ermm. As #C236196003Leo#CDEF guessed, after you go through the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, there IS an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257792"
msgid "If you want to escape from the #C000246204Far Side\nof the Moon#CDEF, just breaking through the\nLabyrinth will be okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257912"
msgid "But that alone won't be any fun, don't\nyou think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257964"
msgid "That's why I've appended a special #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND\nto the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258052"
msgid "Now―time for a question鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258080"
msgid "What is this special technique?\nSenpai, do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258136"
msgid "Ding ding! That's right!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258164"
msgid "Well, obviously you'd know. If you chose wrong\nthere, I would've given you the 8-bit\nspecial, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258268"
msgid "A-and here i-it is!\nYou're something else, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258320"
msgid "But unfortunately, that's incorrect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258360"
msgid "If I had my way, I would want to say that\nthat's correct, but alas, I'm a host right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258452"
msgid "The correct answer is Shield. Or Wall too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258496"
msgid "Please pick up on the social cues, okay,\nimbecile little 8-bitty #[boy][girl]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258576"
msgid "THAT'S the new #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND, #C236196003BB#CDEF's pride and joy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258664"
msgid "\"In the Labyrinth's Core…\nA girl-integrated…?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258716"
msgid "That's right. When it comes to resources,\nusing humans or AI makes no difference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258800"
msgid "Please think of it as an honor that they're\nbeing treated equally, rather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258876"
msgid "Truly, it was an excellent wall, was it not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258924"
msgid "A girl's mind is complicated and mysterious.\nThere's no firmer wall than that鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259004"
msgid "The downside is the limited size and amounts,\nI suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259064"
msgid "A single girl's worth of mind can plaster three\nfloors to the very brim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259140"
msgid "An outstanding Master that can be used as a\nCore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259192"
msgid "Female Masters of dense quasi-Spiritrons are\nrare resources, so they're hard to find."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259280"
msgid "Out of all the Masters I captured,\nI only used #C236196003Rin#CDEF and that girl as Cores."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259372"
msgid "Hehehe… now for some introductions!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259412"
msgid "With an intellectual white gown, glasses, and a\nshiny forehead―the precipitous / smooth,\nslender beauty!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259520"
msgid "Yes! She's the pride of Atlas Institute:\nEarth's last homunculus!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259588"
msgid "\"What lies under her cardigan?\"\n\"Does the Atlas Institute have no concept of\nshame?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259676"
msgid "Thinking about it makes my heart pound too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259720"
msgid "Go ahead. You can make a statement, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259768"
msgid "Let's hear your scathing comments on these\npuppies who will be challenging you from\nhere on out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259868"
msgid "―――#C236196003BB#CDEF. I don't like playing up for\nthe cameras."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259936"
msgid "If they intrude into the fourth floor,\nI'll simply treat them as foreign\ninvaders―and dispose of them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260040"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF was just the beginning, a demo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260104"
msgid "I will prove―――just how dangerous a\nstructure reflecting a young girl's heart\ncan be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260196"
msgid "…what's this I feel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260220"
msgid "I can't see or hear her, but right now,\nI feel like #C236196003Rin#CDEF is loudly booing next to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260324"
msgid "Okay鷙 Thank you very much for the promising\ncommentary鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260384"
msgid "A plain and simple game is no fun.\nThis design doesn't exist in the Near Side's\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260500"
msgid "If you want to reach the outside,\nthen please defeat the unconquerable #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260596"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. In exchange\nfor dropping out of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you've\nall been freed from its rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260752"
msgid "\"The defeated are terminated\"――\nWell, such a rule doesn't apply here anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260832"
msgid "As long as you're here, there's no need to\nvanish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260884"
msgid "…though, having that health management AI\nthere keeping you company really pisses\nme off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260976"
msgid "I AM the one with a compassion deeper than\nan ocean: #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261052"
msgid "As long as you all stay in the school,\nI'll leave you all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261120"
msgid "I can't guarantee your civil rights,\nbut I'll recognize your freedom as it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261200"
msgid "You're each free to have any dreams or\ndelusions you please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261264"
msgid "Your intracerebral simulators run on rather\nembarrassing forces, ones characteristic to\nhumans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261360"
msgid "Please keep discharging your young libidos,\neveryone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261416"
msgid "I'm always in that Labyrinth,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261448"
msgid "wanting and wanting to kill you all,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261488"
msgid "Everyone is alright.\nThis seems to have been only a sight-jack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261552"
msgid "The external access has been severed. #C236196003BB#CDEF\nshouldn't be able to interfere with us at\nwill… at least, I want to believe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261688"
msgid "All she can do is eavesdrop and sight-jack,\nlike just now. That explains why she's been\nsetting traps in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261808"
msgid "So, let's state the Student Council's moves\nagain. Our objective: escape the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. We'll repel #C236196003BB#CDEF's likely interferences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261980"
msgid "Welcoming Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF as Vice President, our\nbackup has grown even stronger. I expect\neveryone to synchronize more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262124"
msgid "After #C236196003Leo#CDEF's speech I nod, \"Of course.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262180"
msgid "…however. That didn't mean that everyone else\nin the Student Council Room agreed.\nThose who nodded were #C236196003Rin#CDEF and I… and with\na reserved nod, #C236196003Julius#CDEF. The three of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262380"
msgid "No thanks for me. I was only here to take a\nlook at things. Didn't I say I wasn't joining\nthe Student Council?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262492"
msgid "We can just leave the risky business to those\nwho HAVE Servants. I won't be lifting a finger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262588"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF agrees with ol' #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF DID say that while we're chillin' here,\nshe won't do a thing to us, y'know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262760"
msgid "Is that so? Shame.\nIf you ever change your mind, you're always\nfree to knock on our door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262852"
msgid "…let's switch. Now, how about you, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nYou declared before that you wouldn't join―but\nthe situation has taken a drastic turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263000"
msgid "Now that this threat, #C236196003BB#CDEF, has been made clear,\nare you still unable to cooperate with us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263108"
msgid "My plans do not change. If my skills will be of\nuse to everyone, then I won't hesitate to\ncollaborate, but to join together is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263240"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF… When we wanted to acquire #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nyou went above and beyond for us, so why…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263376"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF asked a strange question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263424"
msgid "A while back, #C236196003BB#CDEF revealed herself\nas the mastermind after we beat #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263528"
msgid "To us inside the school, she was an enemy\nwe never knew about. Surely, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF wouldn't\nhave known, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263652"
msgid "―――Yes. I met with #C236196003BB#CDEF earlier than everyone\nelse. When we were assaulted by the Black Noise\nin the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263784"
msgid "The reason I don't share the same goal as\neveryone else is because of the pact I made\nwith #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263896"
msgid "In exchange for not opposing her, she would\nspare my life… on that condition, I confined\nmyself to this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264012"
msgid "In that moment, the moment when I abandoned her\nin the preliminaries school, she fell into #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nhands―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264136"
msgid "…now that I think about it, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF said something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264204"
msgid "Because, she said that she \"had no intention of\nleaving.\" #C236196003Kiara#CDEF knew something and had given up,\nthinking that leaving was impossible now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264364"
msgid "All because of that nuance.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF was monitoring #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nShe couldn't give any hint of #C236196003BB#CDEF's existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264512"
msgid "Despite that, since you wanted us to know,\nyou went out of your way to cleverly phrase\nthings, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264616"
msgid "…what a foul imagination you have.\nDon't go farther than something like\n\"her heart will stop.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264712"
msgid "No, there's no physical restriction. If I oppose\n#C236196003BB#CDEF even once, then at that moment, our peaceful\npact will become null and void. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264868"
msgid "…that is why, if the need arises, breaking the\npact will be my final option."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264948"
msgid "Yes. However, remember that my pact is\nto \"not oppose #C236196003BB#CDEF\" all the way to the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265052"
msgid "As far as helping you all escape, I'll be\nlimited by that one condition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265128"
msgid "If that's what she says, but… is this alright\nfor an AI to do, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265216"
msgid "Yes. As long as she only cooperates with us,\nshe is not violating the rule about \"not\nbeing allowed to oppose #C236196003BB#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265348"
msgid "Things would be different if #C236196003BB#CDEF made the rule as\n\"not being allowed to escape,\" but since she's\nprovoking those who can escape to try…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265500"
msgid "Thus, please pardon me. At this time, I―\n#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF―will assist in your requests to the\nbest of my meager ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265632"
msgid "Her reasons for refusing were much different than\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's and #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's \"I can't stomach this\" and\n\"I got nothing to do with this.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265796"
msgid "Let's be happy that she's our ally for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265840"
msgid "…sorry, but can we call it for today? I'm at\nmy limit, physically and mentally. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Give\nme the key to any empty classroom, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265996"
msgid "An empty classroom? If you want to rest,\nthen an infirmary bed would…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266068"
msgid "That's not it. I want to be alone! I'm talking\nabout venting out my stress in a classroom and\nforcibly burying my mental scars!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266196"
msgid "I don't want anyone near me for a while, okay!?\nEspecially #C236196003#NICK#CDEF! If you come over, I will\nseriously shoot beams at you! Beams!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266340"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF storms out of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266400"
msgid "…I see… The impact from the #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF made\nme forget all about how so many of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nsecrets were exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266544"
msgid "Any normal person would be too embarrassed to\nshow their face in front of other people…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266636"
msgid "In spite of that, she participated in the meeting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266688"
msgid "Leaving that aside, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. I have a\nquestion… no, please let me hear your comments\non something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266804"
msgid "…yes. No matter how much memory she builds up\nor is able to hack the system to her will, she's\na management AI with no fighting functions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266944"
msgid "This is helpful information. That's the comment\nI wanted to hear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267012"
msgid "Now then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Let's break for a while.\nYou must be tired, so please rest yourself.\nAfter, we'll have you on General Affairs―oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267164"
msgid "An external transmission. This is… #C236196003Gatou#CDEF?\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, I'm turning the transmission on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267280"
msgid "Brother, turn the transmission off.\nThere's been a lot to take in, so let's all\nhave some dinner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267380"
msgid "…I know how you feel, but wait. This\ntransmission is coming from the Labyrinth.\nIt's not something to ignore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267492"
msgid "It's hard to understand? Is that so?\nThen I'll say this plainly: I'm chasing after\na dangerous homicidal maniac!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267608"
msgid "Since she felt as if she was a god, I urgently\nwent to rescue this lost believer!\nGod save me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267704"
msgid "The other side of this transmission is from the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF… Could it be that\n#C236196003Gatou#CDEF is…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267836"
msgid "Are you stupid, old man!?\nWhy would you go into the Labyrinth alone!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267908"
msgid "What!? She's saying reckless men need to be\nsterilized! What an end of the century we're in!\nThe filth is certainly Quo Vadis!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268036"
msgid "While I said that, it looks like I lost them,\nbut where am I? Wherefore are the stairs of\nreturn? Huh? Am I confined in here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268164"
msgid "…I'm so very sorry, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Before you\ntake a break, please head to the Labyrinth one\nmore time. We need to make sure #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is safe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268332"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF doesn't seem like the type who would die\nvery easily, but the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF isn't\na place for jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268476"
msgid "I don't even have the time to catch my breath,\nbut I have to rescue him―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268556"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268672"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268824"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268952"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269088"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269232"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269388"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269500"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269616"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269752"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269868"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269968"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270088"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270216"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270352"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270496"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270632"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270772"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270888"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271024"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271140"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271224"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271348"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271460"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271588"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271724"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271836"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271968"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272088"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272224"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272336"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272464"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272596"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272736"
msgid "She's supposed to be in the Student Council\nroom backing me up. I wonder why she's here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272828"
msgid "…could it be that she's been waiting\nfor me… or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272892"
msgid "…sorry. I had a question I really needed\nanswered, so I slipped out of the Student\nCouncil Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272992"
msgid "No, I won't give up even under these\ncircumstances. You all don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1273072"
msgid "I don't really know why."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1273100"
msgid "For everyone's sake."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1273124"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1273168"
msgid "For everyone's sake.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1273208"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273268"
msgid "Is… that so.\nThough you don't know why, you believe.\nIt really is hard for an AI to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273360"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF gives a seemingly lonely laugh.\nCaught up in the moment, I also give a strained\nlaugh, and nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273480"
msgid "I don't know the reason why,\nbut… I can't go running away.\nSince that belief is lit up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273580"
msgid "It wasn't that you fight even though you won't\nwin… You have to fight even if you don't\nwin, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273684"
msgid "Great! Now it seems like I can understand\nSenpai better!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273744"
msgid "I still haven't been able to analyze the cause,\nbut I want to try speaking with #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nmore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273856"
msgid "The reason why I fight, which #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came to ask me for…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273932"
msgid "While it is for the purpose of getting #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nthe others, and myself out of here,\nit's also to assuage #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Equally as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274112"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF lowers her shoulders, and, while\nshrinking away, looks up at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274200"
msgid "I repeated the same answer.\nAs a result of restating myself, I became a bit shy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274284"
msgid "I will assist you!\nPlease, absolutely come back as the Senpai\nyou are now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274364"
msgid "There are sounds of light tapping on a keyboard.\nNaturally, they're nothing more than localizations――\ntransformations upon my sight and hearing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274512"
msgid "Ordinarily, a #ROFS0003#RUBS  Magi's#RUBE#C000246204Wizard's#CDEF#REND hacking wouldn't need visible computers,\nbut here in the Student Council Room,\nthis is how everyone shares information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274704"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF purposefully used the expression \"last night.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274772"
msgid "This old school has no night,\nbut getting a morning's greeting puts us at ease.\nIt's immensely beneficial to our mental health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274900"
msgid "Hehe. Looking at your face first thing in\nthe morning is pretty nice. I suppose this is\nwhat it's like in school dormitories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275028"
msgid "Oh? If you'd like, we could make a cafeteria or \nsomething. IF we have the memory for it,\nof course. We can take turns being the cook."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275164"
msgid "That's a great idea. Striving to revitalize our\nwork through stimulating our minds\nis reasonable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275264"
msgid "If we have spare memory, then let's definitely\nconsider it. Ahh―the problem is, who has or\nhasn't a chef's skills? #C236196003Gawain#CDEF, do you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275412"
msgid "Unfortunately, the duties of a knight don't\ninclude the preparation of food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275492"
msgid "Besides, I'm vegetarian…\nI hold no prowess in preparations involving\nmeat and oil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275576"
msgid "What about #C236196003Julius#CDEF?\nHe may not look it, but he seems pretty good\nat home cooking, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275680"
msgid "My brother's curry was… unique, in a sense.\nI think there's still some uneate―left over,\nso let's treat you later, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275828"
msgid "Curry? That crunchy stuff you usually have,\nhuh…? If I had to choose, it would be Chinese,\nbut okay. I'll try it if you say it's good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275964"
msgid "If I had to choose, it would be Chinese,\nbut okay. I'll try it if you say it's good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276052"
msgid "…gnhh. Even I'm hopeless when it comes to\nfood too. Since I can only make 5-grain\nporridge, don't expect much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276164"
msgid "There's no one with low-spirits to be found\nin the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276240"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF must have been continuing\ntheir analysis of #C236196003BB#CDEF and the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nbut clearly they haven't lost\nthe sense of their \"usual selves.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276448"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF isn't around…\nor rather, she probably hasn't woken up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276528"
msgid "If she was monitoring the Student Council Room,\nshe would be interjecting in #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's statements."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276644"
msgid "I smile back, \"That's 'cause you're making me listen\nto this silliness so early in the morning.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276744"
msgid "I got plenty of rest, and I have reliable allies.\nNow it's our turn, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I, to head off to the search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276868"
msgid "Excuse me.\nThis is #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, requesting permission\nto enter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276948"
msgid "Good day, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF. Your pupils are more\ndilated than in usual times. Is there something\nto be wary of?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277080"
msgid "I'm genuinely elated, but before we get\nto anything, her outfit is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277152"
msgid "This uniform?\nPer #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's instructions, I changed\ninto this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277240"
msgid "The design makes me uneasy, but as a member of\nthe Student Council, there's no other choice.\nDo you have any thoughts you want to share?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1277380"
msgid "Student Council staff…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1277408"
msgid "Isn't this opposite of your SG2?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277444"
msgid "She looks great… actually, she looks\nvery attractive.\nI plainly shared that thought with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277540"
msgid "The combination of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's tanned skin with the\narchaic school uniform looked extremely exotic\nand also had an irreproducible freshness to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277700"
msgid "…fresh is a good thing. I'll be incorporating\na portion of this design into the next era of\nAtlas Institute uniforms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277820"
msgid "And about THAT, I forbid you to reveal anything.\nIf you do so anyway, I might not be able to\nrepress the same emotions I had alongside #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277976"
msgid "Ah, call me if it comes to that, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. If that\ndummy goes babbling about our secrets, it'll\ntake the both of us to let loose on #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278136"
msgid "Good. A splendid plan, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. I'm hopeful\nof your heartless barbarism. How about \"#C000246204After\nSchool Execution Alliance#CDEF\" for our team name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278312"
msgid "…it's a bit too on the nose. It has a very\nback-alley vibe to it. How about something like,\n\"#C000246204Sailor Suit Rebellion Club#CDEF\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278452"
msgid "I repent from the bottom of my heart, \"I apologize.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278508"
msgid "I want them to stop concocting a plan to\nexecute someone with such serious looks\non their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278608"
msgid "She's starting today as a Student Council\nmember, and I'll be having her pair up with Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. #C236196003Rani#CDEF, your acceptance speech please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278780"
msgid "I am #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF.\nAs a result of all your efforts,\nI was freed from #C236196003BB#CDEF's control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278892"
msgid "I'll use my abilities to serve as treasurer. So\nlong as I'm here, all revenue and expenditures\nwill be transparent. I won't accept waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279032"
msgid "By my motto of swift and accurate Labyrinth\nsearches, I'll support the human-error prone\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the playful #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279200"
msgid "…well, excuse me for being\nthe biggest screw-up around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279264"
msgid "But with #C236196003Rani#CDEF as treasurer,\nthere goes our plan for a cafeteria.\nIt would be a pretty big waste of memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279388"
msgid "Not so. Establishing a cafeteria IS going\ntoo far, but I approve of a breakfast system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279476"
msgid "Give energy to one's soul…?\nYou're talking about motivation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279540"
msgid "Yes. Vitality, the energy to exist. In Chinese\nstyle, it's what lies in the abdomen.\nIn ethnic style, I suppose it's Kundalini."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279668"
msgid "Yeah, energy and the abdomen. Kundalini.\nVitality is the desire to leave descendants…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF! What are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279808"
msgid "#RUBS  Prana#RUBEEnergy#REND is the foundation for activity in life.\nTo activate one's Chakra…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279904"
msgid "Aggh, enough!\nAnyway, I'll explain our current situation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279964"
msgid "And we beat that pest, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. Now, if we can\ncapture #C236196003BB#CDEF and exit the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nwe can return to the Near Side of the Moon…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280148"
msgid "We didn't finish the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280204"
msgid "That's correct.\nBeyond that wall where I was seized was\ndefinitely the \"end of the Labyrinth.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280300"
msgid "She may have divined that my wall would be\nbroken and began appending to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280388"
msgid "If the exit was behind you, then couldn't we\nget to the Near Side from the sixth floor,\nno matter how much is added to the Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280524"
msgid "That's not right.\nIn the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, there's no concept\nof distance or time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280628"
msgid "No matter how far the distance, as long as it's\nnot \"the end of the Labyrinth,\" the\n\"exit to the outside\" won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280748"
msgid "For us to escape to the outside, all we can do\nis reach the end of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nbefore #C236196003BB#CDEF extends it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280892"
msgid "…I see. In imaginary number spaces, concepts,\nrather than real numbers, become real. Anything\nother than conclusions here are vague."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281028"
msgid "If that's the case, our plan is disadvantaged.\nNo matter how far we reach out, there will be\nno point if the Labyrinth keeps extending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281164"
msgid "Unfortunately, that's not the case.\nI can't append any more people to the Labyrinth\nthan what those two cuties are worth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281288"
msgid "They're parts of me, you know?\nIf I popped them out willy-nilly,\nI'd start turning itty-bitty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281384"
msgid "If I, the Queen, were to be weakened,\nsurely I wouldn't be able to keep you all\ntrapped here, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281488"
msgid "This ever-condescending voice is #C236196003BB#CDEF's…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281548"
msgid "She hasn't had enough of jacking the Student\nCouncil Room's circuits, huh?\nThat means what will follow is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281660"
msgid "Yep. Senpai is so wonderful, always rolling\nwith my punches鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281724"
msgid "Out of respect for your good guess, I'll give\nyou all a big bloodletting service\nthis time, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281824"
msgid "Now then: to all you thoughtless, powerless,\nworthless people in front of the monitor!\nAre you ready to scream?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281936"
msgid "Dun-dun-dun-dun-dun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281960"
msgid "Dun-dun-dun-dun-dun, dun-dun-dun.\nDun-dun-dun-dun-dun-dun-dun…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282028"
msgid "Resounding through the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a playful,\nstylish sound effect…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282116"
msgid "Is it a drum roll of fate?\nOr the resentful voices of unrevenged NPCs?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282188"
msgid "Or the sound of a drill, whittling away stone?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282236"
msgid "Tonight you'll be drawn into a black, bloody world;\nthe new, rumored program―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282320"
msgid "Welcome to [Heartful☆Cursed Night\n―just some easy ghost stories from school]!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282400"
msgid "I will be your host, the heroine of this ghost\nstory, if you'll let me tell it:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282480"
msgid "Could it be that this girl is merely a nitwit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282528"
msgid "…here's the sight-jack without letting us\nconsent, as per tradition.\nEvery time, without fail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282624"
msgid "…*sigh*. I want to change the channel, but\nshe's got the remote. The Student Council Room's\nsecurity sure has a lot of holes…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282752"
msgid "Here it is. The circuitous and backfiring\ncustomary approach. You deal with her, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282844"
msgid "…so it started, huh?\nSince I was kinda prepared and expecting it,\nI'm not that surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282936"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003BB#CDEF shoehorns this plot of hers in\nif she ever thinks she has a weakness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283040"
msgid "Huh? You're spoiling the fun, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283080"
msgid "Jeez, and here I was pausing my construction\nto play with you. #C236196003BB#CDEF is so sad now. Sniffle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283188"
msgid "Praetor, I feel torn. I like unique theater,\nso I don't want to go about criticizing\nthe actress…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283288"
msgid "But this isn't good. Truly, not at all.\nShe thinks she can hold the stage by simply\nbeing cute? This era's theater is depraved!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283416"
msgid "…good grief. If you want to deceive us\nthat badly, at least hide that giggly face\nof yours. Please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283520"
msgid "Ah, hey there, is this Tongue-Cut Sparrow?\nYeah, it's me! The wise mother. Do you have a\nminute?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283620"
msgid "Sorry, would you mind bringing the\n[Oddity/Tongue-Cutter Battousai] here\nfrom your tale? Oh, he's not home? *tsk*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283736"
msgid "…*sigh*. She's salivating, not just from her\nlips, but from her entire body. She's no Bull of\nHeaven; perhaps the Snake of Heaven?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283868"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF doesn't need to point it out.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's fake tears were pretty cheerful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283976"
msgid "Psyychee. Whether they're real tears or not,\nsince your silliness cracks me up so much,\nSenpai―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284076"
msgid "By the looks of it,\nyou haven't been discouraged enough to stop\nsearching the Labyrinth, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284172"
msgid "Your persistence is the one thing I'll\ngive you kudos for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284232"
msgid "However, I'll flick away any stubborn\ndirt until there's nothing left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284304"
msgid "If you become too big a pain in my side,\nI'll abandon you to my #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\nSo please watch yourself, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284428"
msgid "I'm not sure what that means.\nIt feels like it has a different nuance\nthan being defeated or deleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284532"
msgid "A maiden's secrets… \"#C000246204SG#CDEF,\" you called it?\nThat vile #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284636"
msgid "I can't believe you had such an unfair ace\nup your sleeve. I'm so sad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284708"
msgid "I had hoped that you'd be more like a\nrandom mob, without a single redeeming feature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284796"
msgid "…and what's with taking out the gaps in\npeople's minds? What sort of occultism is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284888"
msgid "That's the first spiritual phenomenon that's\nbecome a rumor in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284992"
msgid "Well, before we get to that, I have to say\nthat forcibly exposing a girl's secrets is\nthe scummiest thing ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285104"
msgid "Here's something for a Senpai\nlike that―――Take this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285160"
msgid "A present from me to you, a special #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND\nmimicking what Senpai does!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285260"
msgid "Here's the second spiritual phenomenon鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285304"
msgid "Now, I'll say this one more time.\nWhen Senpai exposes a girl's secrets,\n#[he][she]#'s a bad #[boy][girl]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285412"
msgid "So it won't be a surprise if you get\nlocked up, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285468"
msgid "Yes, that's exactly right. #C236196003BB#CDEF is staunch, huh?\nWonderful. I wish you would take me\nas an enthusiastic associate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285600"
msgid "―――!? No! I didn't mean it, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nWh-wh-what's going on!? Everything she does is\nstylish, I can't help it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285740"
msgid "That's right, #C236196003BB#CDEF. How can he so go far as\nto pry into a woman's affairs and spy on the\nrhythm of her daily doings…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285872"
msgid "Such a man is no gentleman. There's a time and\na place for things… I'll give him that, but\nas a guardian, this is is shameful!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286000"
msgid "I'm not sure what he means or what\nhis point is, but I need to think calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286080"
msgid "There's no doubt, it's as if #C236196003Archer#CDEF is one\nof #C236196003BB#CDEF's lackeys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286172"
msgid "S-so this is what her rules do…!?\nFor example, yeah―――I can't help but see #C236196003BB#CDEF\nas the same type of girl as #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286328"
msgid "…that's right. Excellent, #C236196003BB#CDEF. Even if it was\nfor the sake of survival, measuring the rhythm\nof a Master's daily doings was just evil…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286480"
msgid "What… did he say…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286504"
msgid "!? That's crazy, but you're definitely right!\nEverything about #C236196003BB#CDEF looks charming to me,\nI can't help it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286628"
msgid "Oh ho? That's one heck of a manifesto. Despite\nbeing #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF and all that, you make good\npoints. Actually, I rather like it. I guess?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286784"
msgid "Okay, #C236196003BB#CDEF! I'll be one of your companions!\nWe can even create a good-wife harem of darkness\ntogether! But Darling belongs to m―――Ow!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286936"
msgid "Sorry there, #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nMy blow came in at a sharp angle to the back\nof her head, but hopefully she's alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287060"
msgid "You vile woman! I am a clean, proper, good wife.\nI haven't even an ounce to indulge you in those\nselfish thoughts of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287184"
msgid "Damn you. This one is serious trouble… How\ndare you use that sketchy mind manipulation\non me, #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287312"
msgid "If I don't do something quick, I might cause\nan unfixable rift in our relationship!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287396"
msgid "What's there to say? Even if the Heavens were\nto turn a blind eye to a fiend like yourself,\nI would not. And you're almost out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287524"
msgid "And, #C236196003BB#CDEF, I didn't notice until now, but you're\nconsiderably beautiful. Especially your bosom.\nThey're NOT my type, but somehow still nice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287680"
msgid "How about it? We can jointly invest in creating\na club of bliss, where we revel in \npeople's secrets with grins and drink?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287804"
msgid "How about I give you no interest, no collateral,\nperpetual loans of my stored gold? What?\nWhy would I go so far for you, you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287936"
msgid "Hmph―――You're ever the more sinful for\nmaking me say it, woman. #C236196003BB#CDEF. You are absolutely\nNOT my type, but you may become my Queen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288084"
msgid "Loaning at no interest and with no collateral?\nAren't you getting swindled, big time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288172"
msgid "Wh-what did I―what's going on!? This needlessly\nconspicuous breast pedestal appears as a blond,\nblue eyes, petite, and gallant maiden to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288316"
msgid "―――External virus infusion identified.\nConfirmed to be a nerve control agent #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND.\nRemoving special effects."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288460"
msgid "Well, that's okay.\nThe ghost story doesn't end here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288516"
msgid "Something else is what's promising."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288552"
msgid "There's a super scary monster in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288600"
msgid "Someone is always watching you from\nthe shadows, in fear鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288660"
msgid "But listen, Senpai.\nYou'll be better off not exposing any secrets,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288740"
msgid "Curiosity killed the cat.\nThe joke will be on you―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288792"
msgid "Dumb-dumb #[boys][girls]# go straight into the trash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288848"
msgid "If Senpai ignores #[his][her]# cute kouhai's warning――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288908"
msgid "#[He][She]# may find #[himself][herself]# on a one-way trip to hell,\nfast鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288984"
msgid "My proper vision returns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289012"
msgid "Unfortunately, there's no way to defend against\nthe #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF broadcast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289104"
msgid "You can claim that the old school is a safety\nzone, but there's no defense against a massive\nSpiritron output of that degree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289232"
msgid "If that virus was a rabid beast, then #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\nwould be like an earthquake. Beasts can be\nisolated, but you can only endure earthquakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289388"
msgid "Simply traversing the Labyrinth won't suffice\nin accomplishing that, it seems. Let's take a\nstep forward ourselves, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289512"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF seems to have difficultly choosing his\nwords. What does he mean by \"take a step forward\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289624"
msgid "…yeah, you mean that.\nWell, it's about that time.\nWe can't just pretend we don't notice it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289720"
msgid "That's because to #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n[knowing that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF were stolen\nwould be inconvenient for her]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289848"
msgid "If we clear things up, then there's\na big chance those memories can turn into\na countermeasure against #C236196003BB#CDEF's disturbances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289988"
msgid "Hrmm…\nYou can talk about getting our memories back,\nbut how? Should we beat our heads together?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290088"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a record monster.\nIt observes the Earth's, no, humanity's\nactivities. It's the recording eye of a god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290224"
msgid "And it stores those records. That's why―――\nThere's a rule that #C255045045all AI produced by the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF #C255045045cannot erase memory#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290388"
msgid "Take THAT back, is what you mean. But how are we\nsupposed to search for something when we don't\nknow where it is or what it looks like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290524"
msgid "There are two possibilities.\nThe first is that #C236196003BB#CDEF is holding on to them.\nHowever, this is impractical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290644"
msgid "Storing a Master's #C000246204Memories#CDEF is an\nimproper extension of an AI's functionality.\nRather, it's completely useless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290772"
msgid "I don't think #C236196003BB#CDEF is holding on to data which\nwould put a load on her own storage capacity.\nShe must've transferred it somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290924"
msgid "That leaves one possibility left: she prepared\nan external storage repository\nand is hiding it there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291028"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF wants to keep her secrets safe,\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF would be the most\nsuitable hiding place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291160"
msgid "Extracting a Master's #C000246204Memories#CDEF and turning it\ninto a file is an illegal action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291256"
msgid "Thus the chances are high that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF are\ninside the stabilized #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, which is\nin the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF where the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF can't see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291464"
msgid "She's a health management AI for Masters.\nShe can act on Servants and NPCs, but she can't\ntake a human's… a Master's life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291588"
msgid "Even she, who boasts of her computational power\nwhich can construct the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF―the\nArena―#C255045045can't directly harm humans#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291752"
msgid "So, wouldn't that explain why she got\npawns like Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, and I?\n#C236196003BB#CDEF doesn't have the authority to do battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291924"
msgid "…I see. For some reason,\nI felt a kinship with #C236196003BB#CDEF well up inside me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292012"
msgid "Basically, no matter how much space #C236196003BB#CDEF controls,\n\"Masters\" are where it all ends for her.\nLike #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, she can't fight on her own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292184"
msgid "That's why she used people like #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nAll she could do was obstruct us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292300"
msgid "I think #C236196003Rani#CDEF's right. It would explain\nwhy #C236196003BB#CDEF created those#RUBS   Alter Egos#RUBE offshoots#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292432"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF may be a part of #C236196003BB#CDEF, but they\naren't tied down to her fundamental\nduty of health management."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292572"
msgid "That makes our enemies from here on out those\n#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF. Alright, then how about we get\nback to the main issue here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292708"
msgid "However, it's not about just traversing this\ntime around. This will be a dungeon attack,\nwhere we're also searching for our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292860"
msgid "Traversing the Labyrinth is a given,\nbut I also agree with getting our lost #C000246204Memories#CDEF back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292968"
msgid "I don't want to be conversing with everyone\nwith a hazy #C000246204memory#CDEF forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293056"
msgid "Then let's do one last check.\nOur objective is to recover our stolen #C000246204Memories#CDEF\nand overcome the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293204"
msgid "The squad doing the heavy lifting will include\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, with backup from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF. Please allow me to serve as commander."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293388"
msgid "The Tsukumihara Student Council will henceforth\nbegin our third session of activities.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, be careful…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293516"
msgid "Pretty much every Master is gathered\nin the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293584"
msgid "I'm sure you're tired, but I went and called\nyou because we'll be unsealing\nour memories shortly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293684"
msgid "I greet the concerned #C236196003Leo#CDEF, saying \"I'm fine.\"\nThen I observe everyone again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293780"
msgid "Hmm, the mood here is quite taut. And I am\nexpectedly silent. By the way, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF.\nIs breakfast ready yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293912"
msgid "We had forgotten these memories.\nObviously these guys are nervous, wondering what truths\nwere taken away from us by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294048"
msgid "Among them, I suddenly sensed #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nlooking at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294116"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF seems to feel responsible for\nwhat happened to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294212"
msgid "I'll take any reprimandings and investigate\ninto what went wrong.\nYou did a fine job, brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294308"
msgid "Perhaps relieved by #C236196003Leo#CDEF's words,\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF slightly smiles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294400"
msgid "…but, it's a little strange.\nJust now, the smile formed from\nthe lifted creases of his mouth\nwasn't one of joy, but more like―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294536"
msgid "…hey, are you alright, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nYour face and hair are as pale as weeds.\nYou're not going to hurl, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294660"
msgid "I'm not scared or anything! I just don't like\ngetting outdone by you guys!\nC'mon, let's get this over with already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294776"
msgid "Your knees are shaking, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nYour bluff breeds fear all the more.\nBe like me, standing calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294892"
msgid "Nay, my mind is just a tad scrambled, is all.\nBy the way, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF,\nhow do you feel about scrambled eggs?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295020"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003Rin#CDEF's loquacity, the mood in\nthe Student Council Room eased up a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295120"
msgid "The same thought hangs over all of us;\nwe're each afraid of what our \"forgotten\" memories\nwill be like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295224"
msgid "However, we can't stay afraid forever.\nAll the more if there are clues in them\nto help us figure out the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295336"
msgid "I fully understand. I think decrypting\nthese memories will be simple.\nI'll take care of any problems afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295452"
msgid "If we find a bug preventing a solid unity\nbetween the fleeting memories you cultivated\nhere with your recovered memories…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295576"
msgid "It's no big deal.\nEveryone more or less has two sides\nto their personality, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295656"
msgid "I'm me.\nWhichever personality comes out,\nI'll swallow it right up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295724"
msgid "A very typical decisiveness out of #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295780"
msgid "…though I can see a bit of the same\ndesperation as when her #C000246204SG#CDEF was exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295876"
msgid "―――Very well, the #RUBS   Operation#RUBEdecryption#REND will begin.\nEveryone, please remain as calm as possible.\nPlease don't resist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296016"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's voice sounds firmer than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296076"
msgid "In that instant―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296100"
msgid "#C080080080The seal's release finished quickly, far too abruptly.\nI instinctively threw my guard up, despite feeling\nno pain or shock.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296240"
msgid "#C080080080The only thing was that my thoughts were sluggish,\nas if my brain had went numb.\nAs if I was underwater.\nThe alacrity of my thoughts was far slower compared to what\nit normally is. #CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296440"
msgid "#C080080080The act of simply remembering my own name exerts me.\nI get the impression of diving to the bottom of a pool\nand picking up a small coin.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296596"
msgid "#C080080080At the bottom of that pool, I can see\na mound of #RUBS    coins#RUBEfragments#REND that weren't there before.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296724"
msgid "#C080080080Once I focus my awareness and pick from the\nbottom of my thoughts, I see one, and then another;\nTHEIR visages, the ones I had overcome, return to me.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296892"
msgid "#C080080080They're the people I defeated.\nI recall the figures of the competitors\nI finished by my own hand,\nas if it had all happened long ago.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297044"
msgid "#C080080080They include #RUBS    Shinji#RUBEmy friend#REND, beside me right now―#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297132"
msgid "#C080080080The #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF#C080080080's Master―#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297204"
msgid "#C080080080And the assassin, #C236196003Julius#CDEF#C080080080,\nwho bore animosity towards me since the preliminaries.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297328"
msgid "#C080080080Memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080.\nI can still only recall bits and pieces,\nbut I know for sure that I advanced to the 5th Round.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297500"
msgid "#C080080080But that's everything.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297540"
msgid "#C080080080I can recall my memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080.\nBut anything \"before that\"――\nOf the me prior to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080;\nof the history of the #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080,\nwho decided to join this fight;\nand of the reason why I did so――\nIt's all still removed from my memory…!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297904"
msgid "Somehow I endure the dizziness and reassure #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297972"
msgid "Though our memories have now returned,\nnot a single person exhibits a\nsatisfied expression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298064"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, even the expressionless #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nis standing motionless, brows knitted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298192"
msgid "Well, except for one person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298224"
msgid "Enough with that howling!\nShut it, you hodgepodge of a priest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298288"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF crumpled to his knees.\nHolding his nausea down, his breathing grows harsh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298388"
msgid "My legs rush towards him without me telling them so.\nIt surprised even me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298464"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF looked at me, startled.\nFrom his gaze I feel a twinge―――of fear and despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298568"
msgid "…the last update in my memories\nstops after the 5th Round's battle.\nDid everyone else have the same experience?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298684"
msgid "…it feels the same for me.\nThough it's hard to tell if it stops\nbefore the battle or after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298780"
msgid "I'm in a similar state…\nalthough my memories of the 3rd Round are hazy,\nI can clearly verify each and every part."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298896"
msgid "…it appears so. The only thing I can\nremember is who I fought against\nand who I defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298988"
msgid "…I also have memories only up until\nthe 5th Round. I faced off against―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299068"
msgid "\"Who was #C236196003Julius#CDEF' opponent in the 5th Round?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299132"
msgid "…his stare alone served as plenty an answer to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299188"
msgid "―――I see.\nAnd the result was?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299224"
msgid "Sorry, but it's not coming back to me.\nWhat about you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nYou remember our battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299328"
msgid "I shake my head negative.\nAll I can remember is that I did end up fighting #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299428"
msgid "…according to my memories,\nsomething went on between us since the 1st Round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299508"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF was hostile to #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nAll I remember is that he detested me\nfrom the very beginning to the very end,\nconsidering me to be a threat to #C236196003Leo#CDEF that\nmust be eliminated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299736"
msgid "…well, I'm stumped. I speculated that these\nsealed memories concealed #C236196003BB#CDEF's secrets\nor weaknesses, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299860"
msgid "It was all just simply out of\nconcern, to ensure the welfare of our\nrelationships, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299956"
msgid "Who fought who in the Near Side's\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF? Who was our enemy,\nwho did we wish to kill?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300068"
msgid "Indeed, if we had such memories,\nthere's no way we would've helped one another.\nNo, we may've even started killing each other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300196"
msgid "I don't know what the intention was,\nbut I think that's how we have to interpret it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300284"
msgid "Unless, is there someone who remembers\nsomething else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300340"
msgid "If anyone here recalls a secret of #C236196003BB#CDEF's,\nor some inconvenient truth,\nthen please raise your hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300456"
msgid "Everyone is equally silent.\nThat's because all they know is\n\"what happened to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300540"
msgid "There's nothing I can do even after\ngetting these damn memories back!\nI would've been happier if I forgot this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300652"
msgid "Ah―――ah, ahhh DAMN!\nWho the hell wanted you to do this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300712"
msgid "What do we do!?\nWhat are we supposed to do now!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300764"
msgid "His eyes are sunk, cheeks drooping, hair disheveled.\nHis shock is so great, he's falling apart…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300864"
msgid "I should at least say something―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1300904"
msgid "What did you remember, Shinji?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1300936"
msgid "You're gonna torment your hair off, Shinji."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300980"
msgid "T-there's only one thing it could be:\nthe 6th… no, I remembered the heroic sight\nof me advancing to the 5th Round!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301096"
msgid "Nothing's gonna fall off!\nI'm the hairiest guy here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301152"
msgid "Going bald is what old people do!\nIt doesn't apply to a kid like me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301224"
msgid "You're just telling me to suck it up!? You\ndon't how bitter this is for me! Ignoring that\nand getting all annoyed is terrifying, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301360"
msgid "Dammit……\ndammit, dammit, dammit……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301400"
msgid "Talking to him now would hurt more than help.\nAll I can do is leave him be for a while…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301492"
msgid "…something kind of bothers me, though…\nIt feels like my opponent in the 3rd Round\nand the following 6th Round went two ways…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301620"
msgid "Two ways?\nDid you fight two people at once at some point?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301680"
msgid "No, that's not what I mean.\nIt feels like there were two patterns.\nFor example, my next opponent―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301784"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF spoke up to that point,\nthen suddenly fell silent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301856"
msgid "…for a single instant,\nit was almost like I felt her\nglance towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301932"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nIf you can't get your thoughts #RUBS defragged#RUBEin order#REND,\nthen let's have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF take a look at you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302088"
msgid "No need to worry yourself. Thanks. It doesn't\nseem like we have the time to poke holes\ncomparing every little detail, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302216"
msgid "Something inconvenient for you?\nAh, I apologize. Please don't scowl.\nYou're thinking about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302340"
msgid "Even if we can't recall other people's\n#RUBS     records #RUBEcombat feats#REND, I would definitely be able to\nremember everyone I passed by in the halls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302496"
msgid "Yet, I didn't meet #C236196003Jinako#CDEF a single time.\nHow about the other members here? Anyone ever\nsee #C236196003Jinako#CDEF in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302668"
msgid "Everyone identically shakes their head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302708"
msgid "…now that she mentions it, it is strange.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is one of the Masters who joined\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, too.\nHow, among this many Masters,\ndid no one see her \"even once\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302912"
msgid "…well, that girl IS sketchy as can be.\nI guess we'll just have to ask her in person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303000"
msgid "If only we could just get the slightest\nbit of information on #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303088"
msgid "At that same moment―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303116"
msgid "Is your fruitless discussion #RUBS  sweet#RUBEfun#REND?\nNaturally it's #ROFS0002#RUBS   sweet#RUBEpleasant#REND!\nOf course it's #ROFS0004#RUBS    sweet#RUBEdelightful#REND鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303292"
msgid "Our voices immediately cut out.\nLike a goldfish in a bowl,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's mouth repeatedly flaps open and shut."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303416"
msgid "It was something we half-expected―――\na large-scale hack by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303500"
msgid "The Student Council collectively sighs,\ndispleased by the nonsensical meddling,\nand keeps quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303600"
msgid "Please have yourselves an eternal blast during\nthis sweet yet bitter #RUBS        moratorium #RUBEafter-school time#REND!\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303760"
msgid "Hmmm…\nSo this is #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's special\nCode Cast for penetrating minds?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303852"
msgid "The body, mind, and soul components of our\ndigital forms are Spiritronized, but this seems\nto Spiritronize one even further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303980"
msgid "She was a genius, but a heretical one… due to\nher perspective, her ideas, her knowledge,\nand her lack of morality to question them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304116"
msgid "That's right.\nLet's focus on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nwho pushed through her poor state to support us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304220"
msgid "Now, let me warn you of a few things before\nwe begin. Entering a Cyber Frame brings\ndanger with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304320"
msgid "Since #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is an AI, we can control her\ndefense mechanisms. But battle against the\nMelt-Virus probably can't be avoided."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304460"
msgid "Also, I'm concerned about what #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF\nmentioned… about this \"special bee.\"\nPlease go in well prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304584"
msgid "Alright, I finished analyzing the Code Cast.\nWe can boot it up whenever,\nso give us a shout once you're ready."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "1304696"
msgid "Concerning #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's #C000246204Cyber Frame#CDEF:"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1304764"
msgid "You can freely enter and"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1304792"
msgid "exit her cyber body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304816"
msgid "Without having gotten #C236196003Karna#CDEF to agree to help,\nI return to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304916"
msgid "I report to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others about\nhow it all went down, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305000"
msgid "…that's what makes it so surprising. #C236196003Jinako\nCarigiri#CDEF quietly consents to #C236196003BB#CDEF's elimination,\nand despite fearing death, doesn't refuse…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305168"
msgid "Maybe it's her gambler side acting here, but\nthis one contradiction doesn't exist in AI.\nThey always lean to one side or the other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305300"
msgid "In the end, #C236196003Karna#CDEF turned us down.\nWell, we expected as much.\nHee―――Hee hee hee hee hee hee."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305412"
msgid "Why is she putting on a wicked grin after\nhearing this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305468"
msgid "Why? Because it means our\ntrump card is going to see some use."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305532"
msgid "―――In such a short time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305564"
msgid "She's confident about it, so I guess it'll be\nstronger than a doll, but…\nI wonder what kind of magic #C236196003Rin#CDEF used to pull this off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305712"
msgid "A Servant's Spiritron makeup is littered with\nsanitation programs, so I don't think you'll\nbe able to avoid fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305832"
msgid "…and that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305852"
msgid "Once I take care of anything I've forgotten\nto do, I'll come back."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1305920"
msgid "Upon entering the digital frame,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1305956"
msgid "you will temporarily be #C000246204unable to return#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306016"
msgid "Brain waves shifted to wakefulness. Pulse, heart\nrate, blood pressure, breathing, cognition, and\nvitals stable――Conversion safely completed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306160"
msgid "Do you know where you are, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306212"
msgid "I hear #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and immediately look up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306268"
msgid "I find myself back in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306316"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306432"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306548"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306664"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306780"
msgid "Mhm. I was worried for a moment there,\nbut it appears that you safely accomplished\na mighty task. Splendid, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306900"
msgid "…well, to tell the truth, I would've liked \nif you stayed there a tad longer… but we have\nurgent business. I'll have to make do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307032"
msgid "Nice job. I was worried how far you'd get,\npaired up with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nbut you knocked it out of the park."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307152"
msgid "…although, thinking about it, you faced off\nagainst me this time. You know my tricks better\nthan anyone, so of course you won."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307280"
msgid "―――Phew. Everything went smooth, indeed.\nSplendid work, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307372"
msgid "But alas… ahh, how loathe I am to part\nfrom that paradise of an experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307452"
msgid "This is what it means to be entranced,\nand I may get hooked on it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307520"
msgid "I wasn't aware of any seals, but… that #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\ndoes fine work, surprisingly. It appears my\nprimordial linchpin has been fully released."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307672"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307816"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307960"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308104"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308248"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308372"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308496"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308620"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308744"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308904"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309064"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309224"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309384"
msgid "Ah, no! You mustn't use it here! Its power\nis extraordinary, it may bring down\nthe old school building's systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309500"
msgid "Also… know that it's a very powerful engine,\nso please be cautious when using it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309584"
msgid "…I'm fully aware. I got a sense of what\n#C000246204Mythical Mystic Codes#CDEF are. I'll only wear\nit when it's time to finish things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309720"
msgid "Gosh. It's not like it'll turn me into massive\nsize. #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF really wants to try it on!\nI mean, it fairly―――O-ohh…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309856"
msgid "Was this what I would wear in my origins!?\nAh, okay, let's make a show out of this one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309944"
msgid "May as well… right!?\nI've decided―when I do the unveiling,\nit will be during our final battle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310044"
msgid "Obviously. Living up to my myth isn't so\ndemanding that I would break, but a king's true\nface is not something to show so readily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310176"
msgid "I shall cast aside my pride during the final\nbattle only. Until then, I'll devote\nmyself to this amusing excursion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310292"
msgid "―――Then the conditions have been laid out.\nWe got our hands on a way to counter #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nNo more objections, right, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310448"
msgid "…yes. Though the raw chance is low,\nthere's now a possibility of eliminating #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310548"
msgid "Once #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF arrives at my wall…\nAt the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF's Core, I'll remove it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310664"
msgid "Now there are no more walls in our way,\nno more impassable obstacles to impede us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310748"
msgid "All that's left to do is head to the Central Region\nwith #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, and this will all be over―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310860"
msgid "Hold on. How about we get a full night's rest\nbefore that? Don't we have enough time to spare\nfor that, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311012"
msgid "Yes, of course. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's suggestion\nhas taught me something about how to time\nbreaks effectively."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311132"
msgid "As a special treat, I'll try seeing if I can\nchange our outside location. I hope\nI can make it look like nighttime…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311252"
msgid "Okay. With that, we'll adjourn for the time\nbeing. Everyone, if there's anything left for\nyou to do, wrap it up quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311372"
msgid "Also… #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. Know that what we're\ntrying to do will end up destroying the\nold school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311484"
msgid "I bet the NPCs are against it.\nI'm moving forward regardless.\nI'm well aware of how tyrannical it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311588"
msgid "However, that's not the kind of person you are.\nYou have virtue… or rather, humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311676"
msgid "If there's anyone you want to make that clear\nto, go get that done too. Even if you end\nup not coming to an understanding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311800"
msgid "There's not much to say about the mood\nthroughout the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311876"
msgid "Although everyone is absorbed in their work,\nthe mood is dignified and clear―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311960"
msgid "Basically, it's the same morning scene it's always been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312020"
msgid "Oh? Morning, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nRefreshed after a night's sleep?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312092"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI can have a morning meal prepared at once,\nif you'd like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312192"
msgid "We can have tea afterwards.\nDo you all like having tea after breakfast?\nOr maybe you're all more the coffee type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312308"
msgid "…I find myself grinning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312336"
msgid "Even though―or rather, because it's our last morning,\nthe girls are making good use of the day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312436"
msgid "Looky here! My processing speed is as fast as \nlightning! You look like you're in good shape,\ntoo, but I'll give you a run for your money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312576"
msgid "I removed various guards, making me more solid.\nI feel refreshed, like when a diet starts\nshowing progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312684"
msgid "Yeah, it's just like when you start trimming\nsome belly squish―― Er, forget it.\nNevermind. I've never been fat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312800"
msgid "A-anyway, I'm all set on my side.\nDon't worry about a thing,\njust jump straight into that final battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312904"
msgid "All my self-diagnosis system levels are nominal.\nI'm able to maintain my avatar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312988"
msgid "However… Every time I think about how I'll\nnever see this setting again, my emotion\nregulator produces not unpleasant feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313120"
msgid "My self-diagnoses aren't being affected,\nso it may be a product of my cerebral nerves…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313208"
msgid "It surprises even me that I have such thoughts\nof \"attachment\" to this place,\nhaving kept so distant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313312"
msgid "My #C000246204SGs#CDEF were forcibly extracted,\nI had disgraceful qualities made up for me――\nMy time here was quite the headache…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313448"
msgid "But now, I feel like even those errors\nare precious to me. All in all,\nI think I had a worthwhile experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313560"
msgid "Now please head off to battle.\nIt's time for you to put an end to this,\nby your own hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313652"
msgid "Ah… e-erm… I-I don't really have any\nwords to send you off with!\nI couldn't think of anything \"cool\" to say…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313764"
msgid "I'm hopeless, aren't I…\nAll I can ever talk about is work…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313828"
msgid "End of the line.\nThe monitor is out, our comms are out.\nNow we've got nothing to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313916"
msgid "Okay. Alright, let's split up areas to wrap up.\nYou take the Student Council Room, #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll take the school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314052"
msgid "Understood. We'll use all the memory\nand power source here to bolster\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's defenses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314160"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF left already, did she?\nGuess it's just us then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314232"
msgid "Maintaining the Student Council Room takes up\nmemory, anyway. And I don't like the idea of\nwaiting around to see if #[he][she]# wins or loses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314376"
msgid "…hmph. Sorry for acting tough.\nWe've got nowhere else to go but back to\nthe Near Side when this place is gone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314488"
msgid "And that's a scary thought.\nRight now, there's no future for us\nunless #[he][she]# wins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314580"
msgid "If we get back in the Near Side just to pop back\ninto bodies dying from euphoria to then drop\nstraight dead―――That would not be fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314716"
msgid "…hehe. As if you pay that any mind.\nIt's truly difficult for me to understand\nthe way you show concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314824"
msgid "We firmly believe that #[he][she]#'ll come out\nvictorious. That's why we're afraid―about what\nawaits us when we return to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314964"
msgid "And no wonder.\nAs I recall, my next opponent is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315020"
msgid "…ahh, same for you, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?\nThen one thing's for sure:\nthings won't be getting any easier for us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315136"
msgid "Who knows? If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF returns to normal,\nthen all the events that occurred in the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF will be erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315296"
msgid "All of our encounters, all the time we\nspent together, all our shared\nlaughs―everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315388"
msgid "My guess is that we'll completely forget\nabout this as \"one possibility that\nmay have happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315488"
msgid "Ah. This was a nighttime dream the entire time.\nThe moment the Near Side's future is protected,\nthe events of the Far Side get wiped clean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315628"
msgid "Yes, unfortunately.\nIs that something we should be celebrating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315692"
msgid "Looks like we're just about at the limit.\nYou can go on ahead if you want, #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315792"
msgid "Don't be a stranger. When we exit,\nwe exit at the same time.\nWe'll let #[him][her]# take care of the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315900"
msgid "Yes.\nAnd you made for the finest #ROFS0004#RUBSstaff#RUBEally#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315968"
msgid "Thank you――and thanks for all your\nhard work this whole time. Well then,\nlet's meet up again in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

